    "[sai] spends the next few minutes explaining the pedagogue's biography to you. Apparently, she did things that were revolutionary for her time."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:645
translate english c23s002_Montessori_01d25fc0:

    # "Pero es una historia en la que se entrevén muchos grises."
    "But it's a story in which many grays are glimpsed. Nothing is black or white in the real world."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:649
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_a5389849:

    # mc "¡Verde. Vamos a tener un bebé!"
    mc "Green! We're having a baby!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:651
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_b0eb6df2:

    # sai "Felicidades, cielo. Sé que te hacía ilusión."
    sai "Congratulations, sweetheart. I know you were looking forward to it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:652
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_0b584a5b:

    # mc "No suenas muy contenta."
    mc "You don't sound very happy."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:654
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_2d6f41fa:

    # sai "Estoy contenta, pero preocupada."
    sai "I am happy, but worried."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:655
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_851b9294:

    # mc "¿Por la carrera? Te ayudaremos en todo lo que podamos."
    mc "For the degree? We'll help you in any way we can."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:657
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_f2f8f8f9:

    # sai "No, la carrera no me preocupa demasiado. Me parece raro tener un bebé antes de acabarla, pero ya está."
    sai "No, I'm not too worried about the degree. I think it's weird to have a baby before I finish school, that's all."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:658
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_7ddf9ba8:

    # sai "Me preocupa decírselo a mis padres."
    sai "I'm worried about telling my parents."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:659
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_0cabfb10:

    # mc "¿Cómo se lo van a tomar?"
    mc "How are they going to take it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:661
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_2c5430c4:

    # mc "Bueno, si quieres que esté ahí para decírselo, cuenta conmigo..."
    mc "Well, if you want me to be around to tell them, count me in..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:663
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_1219b8ff:

    # sai "No te preocupes. No se lo voy a decir todavía."
    sai "Don't worry. I'm not going to tell them yet."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:664
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_038560de:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Cuánto quieres esperar?"
    mc "Why? How long do you want to wait?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:666
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_c5240d56:

    # sai "Como mínimo, hasta que Kaly esté aquí. Si les digo que me he quedado embarazada del dueño de la residencia, no le van a dejar venir."
    sai "At least until Kaly is here. If I tell them I'm pregnant by the owner of the residence, they would forbid her to come."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:667
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_4244b12a:

    # sai "Van a pensar que la vas a dejar embarazada en cuanto llegue..."
    sai "They're going to think you're going to get her pregnant as soon as she sets foot here..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:669
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_b7a9c78c:

    # sai "Y eso que tu fama de embarazador no ha llegado aún hasta India."
    sai "And that's thinking that your reputation for getting your girls pregnant has not yet reached India."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:670
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_3f1f807c:

    # mc "No tengo intención de tener nada con Kalyani, [sai]."
    mc "I have no intention of pursuing Kalyani, [sai]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:672
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_8e90b55d:

    # sai "*Risa* En cuanto veas esos grandes ojos parpadeando en tu cara, me lo confirmas."
    sai "*Laugh* I want to hear you say that again after you see those big eyes twinkling in your face."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:673
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_5aacd3bb:

    # mc "Bueno, pero aparte de lo de tus padres, ¿cómo estás tú?"
    mc "Well, but aside from your parents, how are you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:675
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_a7bc00ad:

    # sai "Ya te digo que estoy contenta, aunque..."
    sai "I tell you, I'm happy, even though..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:676
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_3b916da8:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa?"
    mc "What's the matter?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:678
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_ed7721cb:

    # sai "No voy a poder volverme a poner este top en cuanto éstas empiecen a crecer. Voy a tener que cambiar el vestuario."
    sai "I won't be able to wear this top again as soon as these two start to grow. I'm going to have to change a lot of my wardrobe."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:679
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_29681486:

    # mc "*Risa* Vas a estar guapísima lleves lo que lleves."
    mc "*Laugh* You're going to look gorgeous whatever you wear."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:681
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_5b606ea9:

    # sai "No es cómo esperaba que pasara, pero estoy más contenta de lo que parezco. Tan solo me siento rara de tener que ocultárselo a mis padres."
    sai "It's not how I expected it to happen, but I'm happier than I look. I just feel weird about having to hide it from my parents."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:682
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_490a5817:

    # mc "No se lo ocultas, retrasas la noticia tan solo."
    mc "You're not lying to them; you're just delaying the news."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:684
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_50ec1616:

    # sai "¡Vamos a la piscina! Quiero darles la noticia al resto de las chicas. Después lo publicaré en el grupo de WhatsUp."
    sai "Let's go to the pool! I want to break the news to the rest of the girls. Then I'll post it in the WhatsUp group."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:685
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_c884d001:

    # mc "¿En el que estoy yo o en el que no estoy?"
    mc "The one I'm in or the one I'm not?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:687
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_f50b3bac:

    # sai "En los dos. En el tuyo no contestará casi nadie, pero lo publicaré por si alguien quiere felicitarte a ti."
    sai "Both of them. Almost no one will reply to yours, but I'll post it in case anyone wants to congratulate you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:688
translate english c23s002_SaiPregnant_831b697a:

    # mc "*Risa* A veces os odio. Vamos."
    mc "*Laugh* You know, sometimes I hate you guys. Let's go."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:692
translate english c23s002_parents_7589d59f:

    # sai "Imagínate enviar a tu hija al extranjero a estudiar y que antes de que acabe la carrera se quede embarazada."
    sai "Imagine sending your daughter abroad to study and, before she finishes her degree, she gets preggers."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:693
translate english c23s002_parents_f5a86a18:

    # sai "Y del dueño de la residencia de estudiantes nada menos... Y sin estar casados..."
    sai "And from the owner of the student residence, no less... And without being married..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:694
translate english c23s002_parents_3c948955:

    # mc "Me lo puedo imaginar. Ya me dijiste que eran muy tradicionales."
    mc "I can imagine. You already told me they were very traditional."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:696
translate english c23s002_parents_0da23dec:

    # sai "*Risa triste* ¿Tradicionales? Une a eso retrógrados y te acercarás a una versión modernizada de mis padres."
    sai "*Sad laughter* Traditional? Couple that with retrograde and you're getting closer to a modernised version of my parents."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:697
translate english c23s002_parents_1b3c77e8:

    # sai "A veces parece que vivan en el Siglo XIX o el XX."
    sai "Sometimes it seems as if they live in the 19th or 20th century."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:701
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_26eea004:

    # mc "Rojo. No vamos a tener un bebé aún."
    mc "Red. We're not having a baby yet."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:703
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_d975b988:

    # sai "Bueno, otra vez será. No tenemos prisa."
    sai "Well, some other time. We're in no hurry."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:704
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_2537456b:

    # mc "No suenas muy decepcionada. Eso es bueno."
    mc "You don't sound too disappointed. That's good."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:706
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_e6495c22:

    # sai "Estoy decepcionada, pero, por otro lado, estoy aliviada."
    sai "I am disappointed, but on the other hand, I am relieved."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:707
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_851b9294:

    # mc "¿Por la carrera? Te ayudaremos en todo lo que podamos."
    mc "Because of the degree? We'll help you in any way we can."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:709
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_b6444778:

    # sai "No, la carrera no me preocupa demasiado. Me hubiera parecido raro tener un bebé antes de acabarla, pero ya está."
    sai "No, I'm not too worried about the degree. I would have thought it weird to have a baby before I finish school, that's all."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:710
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_4b9b2f05:

    # sai "Me preocupaba decírselo a mis padres."
    sai "I was worried about telling my parents."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:711
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_0beea497:

    # mc "¿Cómo se lo iban a tomar?"
    mc "How were they going to take it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:713
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_6619638c:

    # mc "Bueno, sí, cuando te quedes embarazada, quieres que esté ahí para decírselo, cuenta conmigo..."
    mc "Well, if, when you get pregnant, you want me to be around to tell them, count me in..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:713
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_7eec1ef5:

    # mc "Bueno, si, cuando te quedes embarazada, quieres que esté ahí para decírselo, cuenta conmigo..."
    mc "Well, if, when you get pregnant, you want me to be around to tell them, count me in..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:715
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_e4455855:

    # sai "No te preocupes. No se lo pensaba decir aunque me hubiera quedado embarazada ahora."
    sai "Don't worry. I wasn't going to tell them even if I got pregnant now."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:716
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_d9f65540:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Cuánto hubieras querido esperar?"
    mc "Why? How long would you have wanted to wait?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:718
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_6016f36c:

    # sai "Como mínimo, hasta que Kaly esté aquí. Si les hubiera dicho que me he quedado embarazada del dueño de la residencia, no le iban a dejar venir."
    sai "At least until Kaly was here. If I had told them that I got pregnant by the owner of the residence, they would forbid her to come."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:719
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_e27513d6:

    # sai "Iban a pensar que la ibas a dejar embarazada en cuanto llegara..."
    sai "They were going to think you were going to get her pregnant as soon as she made her arrival..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:721
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_b7a9c78c:

    # sai "Y eso que tu fama de embarazador no ha llegado aún hasta India."
    sai "And yet your reputation for pregnancy has not yet reached India."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:722
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_3f1f807c:

    # mc "No tengo intención de tener nada con Kalyani, [sai]."
    mc "I have no intention of pursuing Kalyani, [sai]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:724
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_8e90b55d:

    # sai "*Risa* En cuanto veas esos grandes ojos parpadeando en tu cara, me lo confirmas."
    sai "*Laugh* I want to hear you say that again after you see those big eyes twinkling in your face."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:725
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_79b68995:

    # mc "*Risa* No me tientes, sabes que unos ojos bonitos son mi perdición."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't tempt me, you know pretty eyes are my bane."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:726
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_b22bd2d7:

    # mc "Pero volviendo a tus padres, la parte buena es que no tienes que ocultarles nada."
    mc "But going back to your parents, the good part is that you don't have to hide anything from them."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:728
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_7bc4da83:

    # sai "Sí, y al menos no tendré que cambiar de vestuario."
    sai "Yes, and at least I won't have to change my wardrobe."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:729
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_b3961c59:

    # mc "¿Por qué?"
    mc "Why?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:731
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_f3513bd4:

    # sai "Si me hubiera quedado embarazada no hubiera podido volver a ponerme este top en cuanto éstas empezaran a crecer."
    sai "If I had become pregnant, I wouldn't have been able to put this top back on as soon as these two started to grow."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:732
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_5f5a76d1:

    # mc "*Risa* Ibas a estar guapísima llevaras lo que llevaras."
    mc "*Laugh* You were going to look gorgeous whatever you wore."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:734
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_15a7439e:

    # sai "Voy a ir a la piscina a decirle a [mar] y a [emm] que el test ha salido negativo."
    sai "I'm going to go to the pool to tell [mar] and [emm] that the test came back negative."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:735
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_427b4919:

    # mc "¿Quieres que te acompañe?"
    mc "Would you like me to join you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:737
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_f0467d0d:

    # sai "No hace falta. Me van a querer dar abrazos para consolarme, aunque no sean necesarios. *Risa* Quiero esos abrazos solo para mí."
    sai "There is no need. They'll want to hug me to comfort me, even if it's not necessary. *Laugh* I want those hugs just for me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:738
translate english c23s002_SaiNotPregnant_91dba7af:

    # mc "*Risa* A veces os odio. Te veo luego."
    mc "*Laugh* You know, sometimes I hate you guys. See you later."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:743
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_75bb8a0c:

    # "Vas al lavabo y vuelves a tu habitación a meter una muda de ropa en una mochila para el viaje de mañana."
    "You go to the restroom and go back to your room to put a change of clothes in a backpack for tomorrow's trip."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:745
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_ecee5073:

    # "Después de pasar por la piscina, vuelves a tu habitación a meter una muda de ropa en una mochila para el viaje de mañana."
    "After stopping by the pool, you go back to your room to put a change of clothes in a backpack for tomorrow's trip."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:747
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_c1485301:

    # "Vuelves a tu habitación a meter una muda de ropa en una mochila para el viaje de mañana."
    "You go back to your room to put a change of clothes in a backpack for tomorrow's trip."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:748
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_12d1537c:

    # "Cuando casi has acabado..."
    "When you're almost done..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:750
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:751
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_bb9c1f60:

    # mom "*A través de la puerta* Soy yo. ¿Puedo pasar?"
    mom "*Through the door* It's me. May I come in?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:752
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_4d601f0e:

    # mc "Sí, pasa."
    mc "Yes, come in."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:758
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_9bbf8b8f:

    # mom "Venía a ver si querías que te ayudara a hacer la maleta para mañana."
    mom "I came to see if you wanted me to help you pack your suitcase for tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:759
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_88471209:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Maleta? Con una mochila tengo suficiente. Una muda de ropa y artículos de higiene."
    mc "*Laugh* Suitcase? One backpack is enough for me. A change of clothes and toiletries."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:761
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_7a59eeaa:

    # mom "¿Sólo eso?"
    mom "That's all?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:762
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_d157fcf1:

    # mc "No necesito más. Es solo una noche."
    mc "I don't need anything else. It's just one night."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:763
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_0299b411:

    # mom "¿Y si llueve? ¿O si hace frío? Deberías coger una chaqueta."
    mom "What if it rains? Or if it's cold? You should take a jacket."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:768
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_54eacab5:

    # mc "[Mom], he mirado las temperaturas en el móvil, y se espera que haga buen día."
    mc "[Mom], I looked at the forecast already on the phone, and it's expected to be a nice day."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:770
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_c95214f0:

    # mom "Nunca te puedes fiar de esas aplicaciones, cielo. Acuérdate de cuando fuimos a Fresno. La app decía que iba a hacer sol y llovió."
    mom "You can never trust those apps, sweetie. Remember when we went to Fresno. The app said it was going to be sunny, and it rained."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:771
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_623d3f2f:

    # mc "De eso hace casi diez años, [Mom]. Las aplicaciones son mucho más fiables ahora."
    mc "That was almost ten years ago, [Mom]. Apps are much more reliable now."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:773
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_56eefaa0:

    # mom "Bueno, pero llévate una chaqueta por lo que pueda ser. ¿Qué camisas te vas a llevar?"
    mom "Well, please take a jacket just in case. What shirts are you going to take?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:774
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_6690c782:

    # mc "Una camiseta. Nada de camisas. Van a llegar arrugadas."
    mc "A T-shirt. No shirts. They're going to get wrinkled."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:776
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_9939e1dd:

    # mom "Deberías llevarte la camisa azul. Tienes que ir bien vestido si vas a reunirte con el obispo, y esa camisa te queda muy bien."
    mom "You should take the blue shirt. You have to be well dressed if you're going to meet with the bishop, and that shirt looks great on you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:777
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_4eddcb7c:

    # mc "*Risa* No soy yo quien se reúne con el obispo, es Tía [bet]. Por una vez sólo hago de chófer, no tengo que resolver nada."
    mc "*Laugh* It's not me who's meeting with the bishop, it's Aunt [bet]. For once I'm just playing chauffeur, I don't have to solve anything."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:778
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_f5adc8f7:

    # mc "Y la reunión ni siquiera es con el obispo, es con un secretario."
    mc "And the meeting is not even with the bishop, it's with a secretary."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:780
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_0cff2902:

    # mom "Pero la acompañarás, ¿verdad? Está muy nerviosa."
    mom "But you will accompany her, won't you? She's very nervous."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:781
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_5f6d22fc:

    # mc "No creo que quiera que la acompañe a la reunión. La llevaré a las oficinas de la diócesis, pero no creo que entrar con ella sea lo mejor."
    mc "I don't think she wants me to accompany her to the meeting. I'll take her to the diocesan offices, but I don't think going in with her is the best approach."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:782
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_d91007c6:

    # mc "De todas formas, le preguntaré, pero dudo que quiera que esté en esa reunión."
    mc "Anyway, I'll ask her, but I doubt she will want me to be at that meeting."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:784
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_98e60a1c:

    # mom "Bueno, pues mete la camisa azul por si acaso la tienes que acompañar."
    mom "Well, just bring the blue shirt in case you have to go with her."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:785
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_4d2532ae:

    # mom "Siempre tienes que llevar algo de ropa correcta por si surge un imprevisto."
    mom "You always have to bring some proper clothing in case something unexpected comes up."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:786
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_fa56d19b:

    # mc "La eché a lavar ayer o anteayer. No la he visto en el armario."
    mc "I threw it in the laundry yesterday or the day before yesterday. I haven't seen it in the closet."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:788
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_8fff1679:

    # mom "Tienes razón, creo que la lavé ayer. Tengo que plancharla."
    mom "You're right, I think I washed it yesterday. I still have to iron it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:789
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_213e7078:

    # mc "No te molestes, [Mom], con una camiseta también voy bien. Además, se va a arrugar en la mochila."
    mc "Don't bother, [Mom], with a T-shirt I'll be fine. Besides, it's going to get wrinkled in the backpack."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:791
translate english c23s002_Lugagge_8d3d8ca3:

