# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1675
translate english c23s004_Kim_b0dea2ba:

    # mc "Pues ya hemos llegado. ¿Quieres que te acompañe?"
    mc "Well, here we are. Do you want me to escort you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1676
translate english c23s004_Kim_7d98cdb5:

    # kim "Gracias, pero no hace falta."
    kim "Thank you, but it's not necessary."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1678
translate english c23s004_Kim_d4ea101b:

    # kim "Aquella rubia es Adeline. De la que te he hablado antes. Mi jefa por esta noche."
    kim "That blonde over there is Adeline. The one I told you about earlier. She's my boss for this evening."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1679
translate english c23s004_Kim_68afdd7b:

    # kim "Iré a presentarme al resto de chicas, y si me acompañas sería como mostrar inseguridad."
    kim "I'll go and introduce myself to the rest of the girls, and, if you come with me, it would look like I'm not confident enough."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1680
translate english c23s004_Kim_1a6ba295:

    # mc "Como desees. ¿Los dos tipos que parecen guardaespaldas también pertenecen al evento?"
    mc "As you wish. Do the two guys who look like bodyguards also belong to the event?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1682
translate english c23s004_Kim_bbeda5a9:

    # kim "No lo sé. Por lo que sé, somos cinco azafatas y otras dos chicas para otros servicios. No me han dicho nada de chicos."
    kim "I don't know. As far as I know, there are five of us hostesses and another two girls for other services. They haven't told me anything about men."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1683
translate english c23s004_Kim_81f6d6f7:

    # kim "A lo mejor son los porteros y los han contratado en otra agencia. No tengo ni idea."
    kim "Maybe they're the bouncers and they've been hired through another agency. I have no idea."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1684
translate english c23s004_Kim_7cd995a2:

    # mc "Pues eres la cuarta en llegar. Falta una cazavampiros y las dos chicas de los otros... servicios."
    mc "Well, you're the fourth girl to arrive. There's a vampire slayer missing and the two girls from... the other services."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1686
translate english c23s004_Kim_051f4639:

    # kim "*Risa* Has dicho lo de servicios como si te sonara sospechoso."
    kim "*Laugh* You said services as if it sounded suspicious to you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1687
translate english c23s004_Kim_1f1e79c0:

    # kim "Se suele llamar así a la gente del cátering, de la limpieza, etc."
    kim "This is the term usually applied to catering and cleaning staff, and things like that."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1688
translate english c23s004_Kim_76125965:

    # mc "Ah, OK. Al decirlo así ha sonado... *Risa* sospechoso."
    mc "Oh, OK. When you said it like that it sounded... *Laugh* suspicious."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1689
translate english c23s004_Kim_73a9eea1:

    # mc "¿Quieres que te venga a buscar cuando acabes?"
    mc "Do you want me to come and pick you up when you're finished?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1691
translate english c23s004_Kim_c4904bff:

    # kim "No hace falta. Acabará tarde y no quiero molestarte."
    kim "There's no need. I'll finish late and I don't want to bother you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1692
translate english c23s004_Kim_5ad080fa:

    # mc "No es molestia. ¿Cómo volverás a casa si nadie viene a buscarte?"
    mc "It's no bother. How will you get home if no one comes to get you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1694
translate english c23s004_Kim_f82ff79f:

    # kim "Pediré un Under o a lo mejor alguna de las chicas puede llevarme."
    kim "I'll call an Under or maybe one of the girls can give me a lift."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1695
translate english c23s004_Kim_c31e85f0:

    # mc "Si tienes algún problema, no dudes en llamarme. Sea la hora que sea."
    mc "If you have any issues, please don't hesitate to call me. Whatever the time."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1697
translate english c23s004_Kim_3225c954:

    # kim "Gracias de nuevo, [mc]. Pero no te preocupes. Si tengo algún problema, te llamaré."
    kim "Thanks again, [mc]. But don't worry. If I can't get an Under, I'll call you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1699
translate english c23s004_Kim_81b83644:

    # kim "Ahora tengo que irme, antes de que llegue la última cazavampiros."
    kim "Now I must go, before the last vampire hunter arrives."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1700
translate english c23s004_Kim_5d67085f:

    # mc "Suerte con el trabajo y, si te hacen pasear bandejas, que sean de canapés y no de copas de champán. *Risa*"
    mc "Good luck with the job and, if they make you walk around with trays, may they be of canapés and not of champagne glasses. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1702
translate english c23s004_Kim_cb4717cc:

    # kim "Muy gracioso... *Risa*"
    kim "Very funny... *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1703
translate english c23s004_Kim_98cbe997:

    # kim "Te veo mañana en casa."
    kim "See you tomorrow at home."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1704
translate english c23s004_Kim_ca435bb9:

    # mc "Hata mañana, [kim]."
    mc "See you tomorrow before going to Monterey, [kim]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1709
translate english c23s004_Kim_022da978:

    # "[kim] se aleja del coche con paso seguro, pasando de largo de los porteros y dirigiéndose a las cazavampiros."
    "[kim] walks away from the car with a confident stride, bypassing the bouncers and heading toward the vampire slayers."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1710
translate english c23s004_Kim_39b267af:

    # "Por primera vez, te la puedes imaginar caminando por una pasarela. Los porteros parecen tener otros pensamientos."
    "For the first time, you can imagine her walking down a catwalk. The bouncers seem to have other thoughts."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1716
translate english c23s004_Kim_cd871e42:

    # "Vuelves a casa y cenas con las chicas. El tema de conversación se centra en el viaje de [bet] a Monterey."
    "You return home and have dinner with the girls. The topic of conversation turns to [bet]'s trip to Monterey."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1717
translate english c23s004_Kim_bb870621:

    # "Que seas tú quien conduce o que [emm] vaya a cumplir su sueño de conducir un Ferrarini rosa casi no se comenta."
    "That you are the one driving, or that [emm] is going to fulfill her dream of driving a pink Ferrarini is hardly commented on."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1718
translate english c23s004_Kim_0bae2113:

    # "Todo el mundo está preocupado con lo que pueda pasar en la reunión de [bet]."
    "Everyone is worried about what might happen at the meeting."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1698
translate english c23s004_Kim_fd2a107a:

    # kim "Después se rio mucho cuando me ruboricé mientras le pedía disculpas. Por suerte solo le manché la cabeza y no el traje."
    kim "Then he laughed so hard when I blushed while apologizing to him. Luckily, I only stained his head and not the suit."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1748
translate english c23s004_Kim_1171553f:

    # mc "Hasta mañana, [kim]."
    mc "See you tomorrow before going to Monterey, [kim]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1773
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_d348568e:

    # "Después de cenar te das una ducha y bajas a la habitación de [mar]."
    "After dinner, you take a shower and go down to [mar]'s room."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1775
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1776
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_70439077:

    # mc "Soy yo, ¿puedo entrar?"
    mc "It's me, may I come in?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1777
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_3e92d953:

    # mar "*A través de la puerta* Sí, entra."
    mom "*Through the door* Yes, come in."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1779
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_564f71da:

    # mc "Quería preguntarte por la camisa azul. ¿La has encontrado?"
    mc "I wanted to ask you about the blue shirt. Did you find it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1780
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_fd0098b2:

    # mom "Sí, la he metido en la maleta de [emm]. En una de las maletas."
    mom "Yes, I put it in [emm]'s suitcase. In one of the suitcases."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1781
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_d2a50ced:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Cuántas se lleva al final?"
    mc "*Laugh* How many is she bringing finally?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1782
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_2ce98e3c:

    # mc "¿Te importa si me siento?"
    mc "Do you mind if I sit down?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1784
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_731a1635:

    # mom "*Risa* Eso es algo que tendrás que descubrir mañana."
    mom "*Laugh* That's something you'll have to find out tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1785
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_d8845d26:

    # mc "Dame sólo una pista. Si fuéramos en tu coche en vez de con la pick up, ¿cabrían?"
    mc "Just give me a hint. If we drove your car instead of the pickup, would they fit?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1787
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_70ce664e:

    # mom "No. *Risa* Seguramente deberíais dejar a Tía [bet] aquí."
    mom "No. *Laugh* You would probably have to leave Aunt [bet] here."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1788
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_943171d1:

    # mc "Vale, me hago una idea."
    mc "Okay, I get the idea."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1789
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_9ad77aff:

    # mc "Por cierto, ¿qué estás leyendo? No sabía que te gustaban los cómics."
    mc "By the way, what are you reading? I didn't know you liked comic books."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1791
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_852f836e:

    # mom "Creía que era una revista. Se llama Días de Dormitorio."
    mom "I thought it was a magazine [nor] bought. It's called Dorm Days."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1792
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_c76428d1:

    # mom "Pero creo que es de [kat]."
    mom "But I think it's [kat]'s."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1794
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_7af44f31:

    # mom "Un grupo de chicas en un dormitorio femenino. Ellas no tienen la suerte de tenerte a ti para ayudarlas, aunque tampoco parecen necesitarlo."
    mom "A group of girls in a female dorm. They aren't lucky enough to have you to help them, though they don't seem to need it either."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1795
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_195caa06:

    # mom "Y... ya sabes..."
    mom "And... you know..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1796
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_044bf7d6:

    # mc "Vale, un cómic lésbico."
    mc "Okay, a lesbian comic."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1798
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_c8aea4db:

    # mc "Quizás se lo pida para echarle un vistazo."
    mc "Maybe I'll borrow it to take a look at it. For science, you know..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1800
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_1f11f99c:

    # mom "Aparte de hablar de mis gustos literarios... *Risa* ¿Querías algo más?"
    mom "Aside from talking about my literary tastes.... *Laugh* Did you want something else?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1801
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_b3f442bd:

    # mc "No, sólo venía por lo de la camisa. No es que tenga intención de ponérmela, pero..."
    mc "No, I was just coming for the shirt thing. Not that I intend to wear it, but..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1804
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_0e04b775:

    # mom "Pero hoy ya has perdido una camisa y no quieres perder más. *Risa*"
    mom "But today you've already lost a shirt, and you don't want to lose any more. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1805
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_0151713c:

    # mc "*Risa* Exacto."
    mc "*Laugh* Exactly."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1806
translate english c23s005_MarVisit_f67bb261:

    # mom "No te preocupes, está en la maleta de [emm]. En una de sus maletas."
    mom "Don't worry, it's in [emm]'s suitcase... In one of her suitcases."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1813
translate english c23s005_NoMar_3ee1513b:

    # mc "Bueno, entonces me voy a dormir ya. Mañana nos levantamos temprano."
    mc "Well, then I'm going to sleep now. Tomorrow we'll have to get up early... for my standards."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1814
translate english c23s005_NoMar_3d6e8676:

    # mc "Te veo el viernes."
    mc "See you on Friday."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1816
translate english c23s005_NoMar_45dc9a44:

    # mom "No, me levantaré para haceros el desayuno antes de que salgáis."
    mom "Nope, I plan to get up to prepare breakfast for you before you leave."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1817
translate english c23s005_NoMar_2c3b5aa8:

    # mc "No te tienes que preocupar por eso."
    mc "You don't have to worry about that."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1819
translate english c23s005_NoMar_e70b3cce:

    # mom "He dicho que me levantaré y lo pienso hacer. No voy a dejar que conduzcas tres horas con el estómago vacío."
    mom "I said I'll get up and I'm going to do it. I'm not going to let you drive for three hours on an empty stomach."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1820
translate english c23s005_NoMar_e4aa384c:

    # mc "Sabes que soy capaz de prepararme un café y cortarme un trozo de tarta, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know I'm capable of making myself a coffee and cutting a piece of cake, right?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1821
translate english c23s005_NoMar_ac66e14c:

    # mc "Pero bueno, no te voy a convencer de que no lo hagas. Te veo mañana."
    mc "OK, I'm not going to talk you out of it. I'll see you tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1822
translate english c23s005_NoMar_f617ec24:

    # mom "Hasta mañana."
    mom "See you tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1824
translate english c23s005_NoMar_554a793f:

    # "Subes a tu habitación y duermes toda la noche sin soñar..."
    "You go up to your room and sleep all night without dreaming..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1825
translate english c23s005_NoMar_b3f31ca1:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 24 – JUEVES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 24 – THURSDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1827
translate english c23s005_NoMar_ec286efa:

    # "... Hasta que la puerta se abre de golpe y alguien enciende la luz."
    "... Until the door opens suddenly and someone turns on the light."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1828
translate english c23s005_NoMar_35ad285c:

    # emm "¡Despierta! ¡Nos tenemos que ir!"
    emm "Wake up! We are leaving!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1829
translate english c23s005_NoMar_4102bb2b:

    # "OK. Ya estás despierto. Y sobresaltado."
    "OK. You're awake now. And startled."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1830
translate english c23s005_NoMar_d525fe1d:

    # mc "¿Qué hora es, [emm]? No he oído el despertador."
    mc "What time is it, [emm]? I didn't hear the alarm."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1832
translate english c23s005_NoMar_2060c21e:

    # emm "Las 6:00 AM. Llevo más de una hora despierta conteniéndome para no subir a buscarte."
    emm "6:00 AM. I've been awake for over an hour, holding myself back from coming upstairs to look for you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1833
translate english c23s005_NoMar_e6da23ea:

    # emm "Pero si no te levantas ya, se va a hacer tarde."
    emm "But if you don't get up now, we're going to be late."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1834
translate english c23s005_NoMar_8e3d2868:

    # mc "[emm], dijimos que saldríamos de aquí a las 8:00. Había puesto el despertador a las 7:15."
    mc "[emm], we said we'd leave here at 8:00. I set the alarm for 7:15."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1836
translate english c23s005_NoMar_cbf421e0:

    # emm "Y en 45 minutos ibas a ducharte..."
    emm "And in 45 minutes you were going to take a shower..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1837
translate english c23s005_NoMar_f4b84d41:

    # mc "Me duché anoche..."
    mc "I showered last night..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1838
translate english c23s005_NoMar_d664759d:

    # emm "A vestirte..."
    emm "Get dressed..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1839
translate english c23s005_NoMar_82b3011a:

    # mc "Soy un hombre. Necesito menos de cinco minutos. Cinco minutos reales..."
    mc "I'm a man. I need less than five minutes. Five real minutes..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1840
translate english c23s005_NoMar_d6f2a180:

    # emm "Y a desayunar..."
    emm "And have breakfast..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1841
translate english c23s005_NoMar_9d17b426:

    # mc "Para eso eran 30 de los 45 minutos. *Risa*"
    mc "That's what 30 of the 45 minutes were for. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1842
translate english c23s005_NoMar_d48c1dce:

    # mc "Puedes ir preparando el café, si quieres ir avanzando. Mamá dijo que se levantaría para hacer el desayuno."
    mc "You can start preparing the coffee, if you want to get a head start. Mom said she'd get up to make breakfast."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1844
translate english c23s005_NoMar_ea722677:

    # emm "Mamá ya está en la cocina horneando algo. El olor es lo que me ha convencido de que ya era hora de despertarte."
    emm "Mom is already in the kitchen baking something. The smell is what convinced me that it was time to wake you up."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1845
translate english c23s005_NoMar_37ec136f:

    # mc "Vale... ¿Tía [bet] ya está despierta?"
    mc "Okay... Is Aunt [bet] already awake?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1847
translate english c23s005_NoMar_4cd12029:

    # emm "¡No lo sé! ¡Aún no he ido a verla!"
    emm "I don't know! I haven't gone to see her yet!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1848
translate english c23s005_NoMar_3a7569c9:

    # mc "¿A qué esperas? Es una mujer y va a tardar más en vestirse que yo."
    mc "What are you waiting for? She's a woman and she'll take longer to get dressed than I will."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1849
translate english c23s005_NoMar_ec138f56:

    # emm "¡Tienes razón! ¡Me voy!"
    emm "You're right! I'm leaving!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1851
translate english c23s005_NoMar_6e734612:

    # "*Blam*"
    "*Blam*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1852
translate english c23s005_NoMar_6713e858:

    # emm "*A través de la puerta* Todo lo tengo que hacer yo en esta casa..."
    emm "*Through the door* I have to do everything in this house..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1853
translate english c23s005_NoMar_efe2aa2c:

    # mcp "(Y se fue. Bajaré a la cocina a ayudar a [mar] a preparar el desayuno.)"
    mcp "(And she left. I'll go down to the kitchen to help [mar] make breakfast.)"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1857
translate english c23s005_Mar_82ff8c0e:

    # mom "¿Quieres quedarte a dormir?"
    mom "Do you want to stay and sleep over?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1858
translate english c23s005_Mar_ec063b6b:

    # mc "*Risa* Creía que no me lo ibas a pedir."
    mc "*Laugh* I thought you'd never ask."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1860
translate english c23s005_Mar_e4a23ead:

    # mom "¿De verdad lo creías? Venir a preguntar por la camisa, cuando no tienes interés en ella, es la peor excusa que se te podía haber ocurrido."
    mom "Did you really think so? Coming to ask about the shirt, when you have no interest in it, is the worst excuse you could have come up with."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1861
translate english c23s005_Mar_0374b3a7:

    # mom "Y saber que vas a estar dos días fuera cuando apenas acabas de volver de la universidad..."
    mom "And knowing that you're going to be away for two days, when you've only just got back from college. . ."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1862
translate english c23s005_Mar_2125c473:

    # mc "Hace más de tres semanas que volví. Y no son dos días. Sólo es una noche."
    mc "I came back more than three weeks ago. And it's not two days. It's just one night."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1864
translate english c23s005_Mar_9c8bbee0:

    # mom "Bueno, lo que sea. A una madre no le gusta perder de vista a sus polluelos aunque sea sólo por una noche."
    mom "Well, whatever. A mother doesn't like to lose sight of her kids even if it's only for one night."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1865
translate english c23s005_Mar_8bfb55eb:

    # mc "*Risa* Y estoy seguro de que me dirás que conduzca con cuidado y que no corra por la autopista."
    mc "*Laugh* And I'm sure you'll tell me to drive carefully and not to speed on the highway."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1867
translate english c23s005_Mar_65ccc2dd:

    # mom "¡Por supuesto! *Risa* ¡Y me levantaré temprano para prepararos el desayuno!"
    mom "Of course! *Laugh* And I'll get up early to prepare breakfast for you!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1868
translate english c23s005_Mar_bdcf4cd9:

    # mc "No hace falta, sé preparar café y coger un trozo de tarta."
    mc "There's no need, I know how to make coffee and get a piece of cake."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1870
translate english c23s005_Mar_86e6ca78:

    # mom "Me da lo mismo. Mis dos niños se van a pasar la noche fuera y no pienso dejar que os vayáis con el estómago vacío."
    mom "I don't care. Both my kids are going out for the night and I'm not going to let you leave on an empty stomach."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:1871
translate english c23s005_Mar_281c7abb:

