    # mom "No corras. Conduce con cuidado. Haz un par de paradas a medio camino para descansar..."
    mom "Don't speed. Drive carefully. Make a couple of halfway stops to rest..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2490
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_32ff118e:

    # mc "No te preocupes, en cuanto lleguemos te llamo para decirte que hemos llegado bien. Espera la llamada alrededor de la hora de comer."
    mc "Don't worry, I'll call you as soon as we get there to let you know we arrived safely. Expect the call around lunchtime."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2492
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a2652fb6:

    # mom "¿Tan tarde?"
    mom "That late?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2493
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c2eaf91d:

    # mc "Cuando lleguemos tenemos que ir a alquilar el coche y después tengo que llevar a Tía [bet]."
    mc "When we get there, we have to go rent the car and then I have to give Aunt [bet] a ride to the church."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2494
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_fa66d2bd:

    # mc "Mejor que la esperes tarde y te llame antes, a que la esperes pronto y me retrase."
    mc "Better that you wait for a late call and I call you early, than have you wait for an early call, I'm late, and you start to worry."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2497
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e0795c02:

    # mom "Hasta mañana, mi amor."
    mom "See you tomorrow, my love."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2500
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_58ac1d50:

    # mom "Hasta mañana, [mc]."
    mom "See you tomorrow, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2501
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6bb4321b:

    # mc "No te preocupes por nada. Vamos dos adultos... y [emm]. Hasta mañana."
    mc "Don't worry about anything. We're two adults... and [emm]. See you tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2503
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_b53a8c44:

    # "Al cabo de unos minutos, sospechosamente cuando todas las maletas ya están cargadas, aparece [emm]."
    "After a few minutes, suspiciously when all the suitcases are already loaded, [emm] shows up."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2504
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_98dad1eb:

    # emm "¡Me pido el asiento de atrás! Así podré echar una cabezada por el camino."
    emm "I call dibs on the back seat! Then I can have a nap on the way."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2505
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ad278a8e:

    # mc "No esperarás ir tumbada, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You don't expect to be lying down, do you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2507
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2f1b87bd:

    # emm "Claro que sí. He dormido muy poco..."
    emm "Of course I do. I slept for a very short time. I was so excited..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2508
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_1baf40e6:

    # mcp "(Y has dejado dormir poco a los demás.)"
    mcp "(And you've let others sleep for a shorter time, too.)"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2509
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f7a399a1:

    # emm "Y no me vengas con que si frenas de golpe me voy a caer del asiento. Conduces como una abuelita."
    emm "And don't tell me that if you slam on the brakes, I'm going to fall off the seat. You drive like a granny."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2510
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5ddd15d0:

    # mc "Era precisamente lo que te iba a decir. *Risa* Bueno, excepto lo de la abuelita."
    mc "That’s exactly what I was going to say to you. *Laugh* Well, except for the granny thing."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2512
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8e89c4e6:

    # emm "¡Pero no puedo dormir sentada! ¡Siempre acabo con dolor de cuello y de mal humor!"
    emm "But I can't sleep while sitting up! I always end up with a sore neck and in a bad mood!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2513
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a041378f:

    # emm "Y eso me va a estropear el día."
    emm "And that's going to ruin my day."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2514
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_191006ce:

    # mc "Lo que me extraña es que no estés de mal humor por haber tenido que levantarte temprano. *Risa*"
    mc "What's a wonder is that you're not already in a bad mood because you needed to wake up early. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2516
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e6d83b0e:

    # emm "¡Hoy había una buena razón para hacerlo!"
    emm "There was a good reason to do it today!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2517
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6a65be27:

    # mc "Bueno, por ahí viene Tía [bet]. Ya nos podemos ir."
    mc "Well, here comes Aunt [bet]. We can go now."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2519
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_60cd69d7:

    # "Tras unas cuantas despedidas más, por fin os ponéis en camino."
    "After a few more goodbyes, you're finally on your way."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2520
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_acd46f2a:

    # "Por suerte habéis salido con tiempo. Había unas obras en la carretera antes de llegar a Atascadero que os han retrasado un poco."
    "Luckily, you left ahead of time. There was some road work before you got to Atascadero that slowed you down a bit."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2521
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a38307b1:

    # "Aún vais bien de tiempo."
    "You're still on schedule."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2523
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_75d8b8da:

    # emm "¿Cómo estás, Tía [bet]? ¿Nerviosa?"
    emm "How are you, Aunt [bet]? Nervous?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2524
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f3201952:

    # mcp "(Extrañamente [emm] se preocupa por otras personas en un día importante para ella. ¿Habrá entendido lo que significa la empatía?)"
    mcp "(Strangely enough, [emm] cares about other people on an important day for her. Did she finally understood what empathy means?)"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2526
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9823ca60:

    # bet "Sí, estoy nerviosa. No tengo ni idea de qué va a pasar en esa reunión, pero no soy capaz de encontrar ningún escenario bueno para mí."
    bet "Yes, I am nervous. I have no idea what's going to happen in that meeting, but I'm not able to think of any good outcome for me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2527
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6d5eb0ec:

    # mc "El mejor escenario para ti sería que te destinasen a otro hospital en África, en otro país, ¿no?"
    mc "The best-case scenario for you would be to be posted to another hospital in Africa, in another country, wouldn't it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2529
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5d599fd4:

    # emm "Eso no, Tía. Nadie quiere que te vayas ahora que te conocemos mejor y que la abuela se va a mudar aquí."
    emm "Not that, Auntie. No one wants you to leave now that we know you better and grandma is moving in here."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2530
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_65730c64:

    # mc "Pero no tenemos que ser egoístas, [emm]. Yo tampoco quiero que se vaya, pero si es lo que quiere ella..."
    mc "But we don't have to be selfish, [emm]. I don't want her to leave either, but if that's what she wants..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2532
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_17d2fc40:

    # bet "Gracias, chicos. Realmente aún no sé lo que quiero. Me gustaría volver a África."
     bet "Thanks, guys. I really don't know what I want yet. I'd like to go back to Africa."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2533
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9408a313:

    # bet "Pero también me gustaría quedarme por aquí y trabajar en algún hospital que me permita veros más a menudo."
    bet "But I'd also like to stick around and work at some hospital that allows me to see you guys more often."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2534
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a8285983:

    # bet "Incluso hay un par de hospitales católicos cerca de casa donde podría trabajar sin mudarme de Newport."
    bet "There are even a couple of Catholic hospitals close to home where I could work without moving from Newport."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2535
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_7409e022:

    # mc "Eso sería fantástico. Nadie quiere que te vayas de casa, pero todos lo entenderíamos si decidieras volver a África."
    mc "That would be fantastic. No one wants you to leave home, but we'd all understand if you decided to go back to Africa."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2536
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_927f1ed8:

    # mc "Bueno, quizás todos menos [emm]. *Risa*"
    mc "Well, maybe everyone but [emm]. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2538
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_219cca74:

    # emm "*Risa* Ni siquiera que gastes bromas sobre mí va a poder estropearme el día."
    emm "*Laugh* Not even you playing jokes on me is going to be able to spoil my day."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2539
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6b3f5e74:

    # mc "Nunca querría estropearte el día, hermanita. Además, tengo una sorpresa para ti, para cuando lleguemos a Monterey."
    mc "I'd never want to spoil your day, sis. Besides, I have a surprise for you, you'll see when we get to Monterey."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2541
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5ffbefca:

    # emm "¿Qué es?"
    emm "What is it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2542
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_67e6de57:

    # mc "No te lo voy a decir. Si te lo dijera, ya no sería una sorpresa."
    mc "I'm not going to tell you. If I told you, it wouldn't be a surprise anymore."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2544
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_44cef866:

    # emm "Decirme que tienes una sorpresa para mí y no decirme qué es... Eso sí que podría estropearme el día..."
    emm "Telling me you have a surprise for me and not telling me what it is.... That could really spoil my day..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2545
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_d51f57a2:

    # mc "Los chantajes emocionales no sirven conmigo, [emm]."
    mc "Emotional extortion doesn't work with me, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2547
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_b8004bc0:

    # bet "Pero la chica lo tenía que intentar. *Risa*"
    bet "But the girl had to try. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2550
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ddf38903:

    # bet "Si eso no funciona, siempre puedes amenazarle con castigarle sin sexo. *Risa* A otras mujeres les funciona."
    bet "If that doesn't work, you can always threaten to punish him without sex. *Laugh* It works for other women."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2552
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_7a2d7a04:

    # emm "¡Eso no! ¡Eso sería más castigo para mí que para él!"
    emm "Not that! That would be more punishment for me than for him!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2553
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f92c1d53:

    # mc "*Risa* Además, tampoco funcionaría."
    mc "*Laugh* Besides, it wouldn't work either."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2555
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_69504a21:

    # bet "¿Y tú que quieres hacer con el coche? ¿Quieres ir a algún sitio en particular o sólo conducir donde la carretera te lleve?"
    bet "And what do you want to do when you get the car? Do you want to go anywhere in particular or just drive where the road takes you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2557
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5f56d875:

    # emm "Había pensado en ir a ver Carmel, he leído que es bonito, y me gustaría hacer unas fotos."
    emm "I had thought about going to see Carmel, I've read it's nice, and I'd like to take some pictures."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2558
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_990a559a:

    # mc "Creo que hoy no tendremos mucho tiempo para hacer turismo."
    mc "I don't think we'll have much time for sightseeing today."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2560
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_37ddc11a:

    # emm "Lo sé. Y mañana tampoco si tenemos que devolver el coche a mediodía."
    emm "I know. And neither tomorrow, if we have to return the car at noon."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2561
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_1f4d80be:

    # mc "Bueno, si no podemos ir a Carmel, te prometo que te llevaré un día cuando vuelva de Aruba."
    mc "Well, if we can't go to Carmel, I promise I'll take you one day when I get back from Aruba."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2562
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_62ca9199:

    # emm "Me parece bien. Y ahora voy a dormir un poco."
    emm "That's fine with me. And now I'm going to get some sleep."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2563
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8aa83788:

    # mc "Pero..."
    mc "But..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2565
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_0740b24c:

    # bet "No la pongas de mal humor discutiendo con ella por una causa perdida, [mc]."
    bet "Don't make her grumpy by arguing with her over a lost cause, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2566
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6c170086:

    # mc "Tienes razón. Va a hacer lo que quiera..."
    mc "You're right. She's going to do whatever she wants..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2568
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ae119aa5:

    # emm "Exacto. *Risita* Pero te haré caso y no me tumbaré. Si das un frenazo, voy a acabar con mi cara en el culo de Tía [bet]."
    emm "Exactly. *Giggle* But I'll listen to you and I won't lay down. If you slam on the brakes, I'm going to end up with my face in Aunt [bet]'s ass."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2569
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_423c7e85:

    # emm "Despertadme antes de llegar, o si paramos para tomar un café."
    emm "Wake me up before we get there, or if we stop for coffee."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2570
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_7bf3a265:

    # mc "¿No vas a tener que parar para hacer pis? Siempre teníamos que parar por ti cada pocos kilómetros."
    mc "Aren't you going to have to stop for a pee? We always had to stop for you every few kilometers."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2572
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c77f999d:

    # emm "Si estoy durmiendo, no sabré si me estoy meando. *Risa* Con lo que os hago un favor echándome una siesta."
    emm "If I'm sleeping, I won't know if I need to pee. *Laugh* So I'm doing you guys a favor by taking a nap."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2573
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_75a9a3a3:

    # mc "Estás aprendiendo a tener respuestas para todo."
    mc "You're learning to have answers for everything."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2575
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_18ce4a7a:

    # "[bet] y tú charláis durante unos minutos hasta que os dais cuenta de que [emm] ya no hace ningún comentario."
    "[bet] and you chat for a few minutes until you realize that [emm] no longer makes any comments."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2576
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c09ba386:

    # mc "Ya se ha dormido, ¿no? ¡[emm.nick] mira, un tractor rosa!"
    mc "She's already asleep, isn't she? [emm.nick] look, a pink tractor!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2577
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_26d40720:

    # bet "No reacciona. Está durmiendo como un tronco."
    bet "She's not reacting. She's sleeping like a log."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2578
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6548d336:

    # mc "Entonces ahora podemos hablar tú y yo. No puedes huir de mí como has hecho los últimos dos días"
    mc "So now you and I can talk. Being in the car, you can't run away from me like you've been doing for the last two days."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2580
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_37b36e4d:

    # bet "No he huido de ti. Tenía muchas cosas que hacer..."
    bet "I haven't been running away from you. I had a lot of things to do..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2581
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e2fb14cc:

    # mc "Y una de ellas era esquivarme. Es culpa tuya que me haya dado cuenta."
    mc "And one of them was dodging me. It's your fault I noticed."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2583
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_d05d7981:

    # bet "¿Mía? ¿Por qué? ¿Qué he hecho yo?"
    bet "Mine? Why? What have I done?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2584
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_acf5c598:

    # mc "Me enseñaste a reconocer los síntomas cuando alguien me esquiva. Como pasó con [kia]. Como está pasando contigo."
    mc "You taught me to recognize the symptoms when someone dodges me. Like when it happened with [kia]. Like it's happening with you now."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2585
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5f814bcd:

    # mc "Desde el incidente con Meemaw me estás evitando."
    mc "You have been avoiding me since the incident with Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2588
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_bbca009a:

    # bet "Bueno... fue un malentendido... "
    bet "Well... it was a misunderstanding..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2591
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_fec0dede:

    # bet "Veros como os vi... me sorprendió mucho..."
    bet "Seeing what you guys were doing when I came in... I was just really surprised..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2592
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ab7f2a20:

    # mc "Me di cuenta."
    mc "I noticed."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2594
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_d704a074:

    # bet "Pero no creo que sea el mejor momento para hablar de esto, con [emm] ahí atrás."
    bet "But I don't think it's the best time to talk about this, with [emm] back there."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2595
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_0cab0d04:

    # mc "Está dormida como un tronco. Lo acabas de decir."
    mc "She's sleeping like a log. You just said so."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2596
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_914f0da8:

    # mc "Y si me sigues evitando, nunca podemos hablarlo. Creo que en estos dos días nuestra relación ha dado un paso atrás, como si hubieras perdido confianza en mí."
    mc "And if you keep avoiding me, we'll never be able to talk about it. I think that, in the last two days, our relationship has taken a step backwards, as if you've lost trust in me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2598
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_55e4dd28:

    # bet "No es eso, cariño. No puedo perder la confianza en ti, no has hecho nada merecedor de ello."
    bet "It's not that, sweetie. I can't lose confidence in you. You haven't done anything to deserve that."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2599
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_561f604b:

    # mc "Entonces explícamelo. No entiendo tu actitud de los últimos días, ni qué fue aquello de \"otra vez\" que dijiste en el baño."
    mc "Then explain it to me. I don't understand your attitude over the last few days, or what was that \"once again\" thing you said in the bathroom."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2601
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_894b0d96:

    # bet "¿Qué sabes de tu abuelo?"
    bet "What do you know about your grandfather?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2603
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5fe65bdf:

    # bet "¿Qué sabes de John, el marido de [mee]?"
    bet "What do you know about John, [mee]'s husband?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2604
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6992db62:

    # mc "¿Qué tiene que ver él en esto? Ahora estoy confundido."
    mc "What's he got to do with this? Now I'm confused."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2605
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9bd43ffa:

    # bet "¿Qué sabes de él?"
    bet "What do you know about him?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2607
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5ea31eda:

    # mc "Lo que me han explicado Meemaw, mi madre, y [nor]. Se conocieron en la universidad, amor a primera vista, y un matrimonio feliz que acabó demasiado pronto."
    mc "What Meemaw, my mother, and [nor] explained to me. They met in college, it was love at first sight, and a happy marriage that ended too soon."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2609
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c5149e5a:

    # mc "Lo que me han explicado Meemaw y [nor]. Se conocieron en la universidad, amor a primera vista, y un matrimonio feliz que acabó demasiado pronto."
    mc "What Meemaw and [nor] explained to me. They met in college, it was love at first sight, and a happy marriage that ended too soon."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2610
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f856635d:

    # mc "Y que parece que todo lo hacía bien y nunca se equivocaba en nada. Pero eso supongo que se debe a que ya no está entre nosotros."
    mc "And that he seemed to do everything right and never did anything wrong. But I guess that's because he's no longer with us."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2612
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e62be100:

    # bet "Sí y no. Hacía muchas cosas bien, pero también se equivocaba en muchas otras."
    bet "Yes and no. He did a lot of things right, but he also got a lot of things wrong."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2613
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a6bdd1ff:

    # bet "No, no era perfecto."
    bet "No, he wasn't perfect."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2614
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_1b377091:

    # mc "Bueno, nadie lo es. Pero una vez alguien se muere, normalmente se olvidan las cosas malas que hizo. A menos que fuera un hijo de puta."
    mc "Well, no one is. But once someone dies, you usually forget the bad things they did. Unless he was a son of a bitch."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2615
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_526ca8a7:

    # mc "Entonces se olvidan las buenas, si es que hizo alguna."
    mc "Then you forget the good ones, if they did any."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2617
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_7f0c7e18:

    # bet "No, con John no era así. De sus equivocaciones te olvidabas a los cinco minutos."
    bet "No, with John it wasn't like that. You'd forget about his mistakes after five minutes."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2618
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_edf7a302:

    # bet "Tenía un don para que sus aciertos y éxitos pesaran mucho más que sus fallos y sus fracasos."
    bet "He had a knack for making his successes and hits far outweigh his misses and his failures."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2620
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2b3e9541:

    # bet "Tenía un carisma especial para hacer que ni te fijaras en sus carencias o en lo que hacía mal."
    bet "He had a special charisma to make you not even notice his shortcomings or what he did wrong."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2621
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_4fd6f76e:

    # bet "Como siempre estaba haciendo cosas por los demás, todo el mundo pensaba que él no tenía problemas propios."
    bet "Because he was always doing things for others, everyone thought he had no problems of his own."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2622
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_477e8157:

    # bet "Tú te pareces mucho a él. Más de lo que incluso [mee] ha descubierto."
    bet "You're a lot like him. More than even [mee] has figured out."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2623
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_45f202a6:

    # mc "Gracias, supongo. A veces lo describís como si meara whisky y sus pedos fueran arcoíris."
    mc "Thanks, I guess. Sometimes you describe it as if he pissed whiskey and farted rainbows."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2625
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c5817933:

    # bet "*Risa* Te puedo asegurar que sus pedos NO eran arcoíris. Sabías que había estado en una habitación horas después de que se fuera."
    bet "*Laugh* I can assure you his farts were NOT rainbows. You knew he had been in a room hours after he left."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2626
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_49aba72c:

    # bet "Bromeábamos con que no fue a Vietnam porque se le consideraba un arma química con piernas. *Risa*"
    bet "We joked that he didn't go to Vietnam because he was considered a chemical weapon with legs. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2627
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_44f9ad22:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno, al menos en eso no me parezco a él... creo."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, at least in that I'm not like him... I think."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2629
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_331c1e76:

    # bet "Sobre el resto, como resumen está bien. Se conocieron cuando [mee] iba a la universidad. John ya había acabado."
    bet "About the rest, as a summary it's fine. They met when [mee] was going to college. John had already finished."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2630
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_b8677642:

    # bet "[mee] estaba en su tercer año en San Luis Obispo y yo acababa de empezar en Stanford."
    bet "[mee] was in her third year at San Luis Obispo and I had just started at Stanford."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2631
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_396c3c56:

    # bet "John estaba trabajando en un pequeño estudio de arquitectura en San Francisco."
    bet "John was working in a small architectural firm in San Francisco."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2633
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_39888221:

    # mc "Sigo sin entender qué tiene que ver el abuelo en todo esto."
    mc "I still don't understand what grandpa has to do with any of this."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2635
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c44ca57b:

    # mc "Sigo sin entender qué tiene que ver John en todo esto."
    mc "I still don't understand what John has to do with any of this."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2637
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_68f149a5:

    # bet "Déjame continuar y lo entenderás."
    bet "Let me continue and you'll understand."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2638
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_67102796:

    # bet "Yo conocí a John antes que [mee]. Me lo presentó un amigo común."
    bet "I knew John before [mee]. I was introduced to him by a mutual friend."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2639
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9f83902b:

    # mc "¿Os llevabais bien?"
    mc "Did you get along?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2641
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6e432726:

    # bet "No hicimos amigos en seguida."
    bet "We became friends right away."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2642
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_baea9b98:

    # bet "Teníamos un sentido del humor muy parecido, a los dos nos gustaba pasear, y salía con mi grupo de amigos los fines de semana."
    bet "We had a very similar sense of humor, we both liked to go for walks, and he hung out with my group of friends on the weekends."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2643
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8516836a:

    # bet "Era el mayor de todos nosotros, pero eso era bueno. Arnold no había sido gobernador y la edad para beber eran 21 todavía."
    bet "He was the oldest of us all, but that was good. Arnold hadn't been governor, and the drinking age was still 21."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2644
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9494eba4:

    # mc "¿Lo llevabais para que os comprara alcohol? *Risa*"
    mc "Did you have him buy you alcohol? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2646
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ad5fa407:

    # bet "Eran los setenta... conseguir alcohol... y otras cosas... era fácil. *Risa* Pero sí, él nos compraba las bebidas."
    bet "It was the seventies... getting alcohol... and other things... was easy. *Laugh* But yeah, he'd buy us drinks."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2647
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_20ab19b8:

    # mc "*Risa* Tía [bet] en plan malota, bebiendo... y haciendo otras cosas... ilegalmente. Me hubiera gustado conocerte en aquella época."
    mc "*Laugh* Aunt [bet] in badass mode, illegally drinking... and doing other things... I would have liked to have known you back then."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2649
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_60943014:

    # bet "*Risa* Yo era una chiquilla divertida en aquella época. Creo que nos hubiéramos llevado bien."
    bet "*Laugh* I was a funny girl back then. I think we would have gotten along quite well."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2650
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f51ac469:

    # mc "Sigues siendo divertida y nos llevamos bien. No ha cambiado nada."
    mc "You're still funny, and we do get along well. Nothing changed."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2652
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_55459c89:

    # bet "Excepto que tengo 46 años más que entonces..."
    bet "Except I'm 46 years older than I was then..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2653
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_395d9e0e:

    # mc "Bueno, la edad sólo es un número. Si te sientes joven eres joven."
    mc "Well, age is just a number. If you feel young, then you're young."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2655
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_1bb5e936:

    # bet "¡Qué fácil parece todo a tu edad!"
    bet "How easy it all seems at your age!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2656
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_6e1125b6:

    # bet "Pero volviendo a John..."
    bet "But going back to John..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2657
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_720e0757:

    # bet "Nos llevábamos tan bien que empecé a ver cosas dónde no las había."
    bet "We were getting along so well, that I started seeing things where there weren't any."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2658
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e3c28eeb:

    # bet "Me hacía la encontradiza con él para verlo, paseaba cerca de su trabajo, de su casa..."
    bet "I used to walk near his work to see him... by chance... Near his house too..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2659
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_83728b01:

    # mc "Vaya, que te enamoraste como una adolescente."
    mc " Oh my, you fell in love like a teenager."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2661
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_de131cf3:

    # bet "*Risa triste* ¡Era una adolescente!"
    bet "*Sad laughter* I was a teenager!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2662
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c9cdb920:

    # bet "Pero sí, enamorada hasta las trancas. Y un poco acosadora."
    bet "But yes, head over heels. And I became a bit of a stalker."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2663
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_bfcfc81c:

    # mc "Esas cosas pasan cuando eres joven."
    mc "Those things happen when you're young."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2665
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_90cc7385:

    # bet "Ya te dije que yo vivía en una caravana cerca del campus, ¿no?"
    bet "I already told you I lived in a camper near the campus, didn't I?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2666
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_0e7ce500:

    # mc "Sí, la caravana rosa de la que [emm] estaría orgullosa."
    mc "Yes, the pink camper that [emm] would be proud of."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2668
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5e564651:

    # bet "Pues [mee] vino a visitarme un fin de semana, se iba a quedar a dormir en la caravana el viernes y el sábado."
    bet "Well, [mee] came to visit me one weekend, she was going to stay in the camper on Friday and Saturday night."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2670
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_83578eae:

    # mc "Y conoció al abuelo."
    mc "And she met grandpa."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2672
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f0d2d10b:

    # mc "Y conoció a John."
    mc "And she met John."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2674
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9c437df7:

    # bet "Exacto. La llevé a una bar, donde había quedado con mi grupo de amigos y se la presenté a todo el mundo."
    bet "Exactly. I took her to a bar, where my group of friends were hanging out, and introduced her to everyone."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2675
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_aff28618:

    # bet "Y ahí entra lo que tú conoces. Amor a primera vista."
    bet "And then you know what happened. Love at first sight."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2676
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_907e6dd5:

    # bet "Él arquitecto. Ella estudiando arquitectura. Empezaron a charlar y encajaron."
    bet "He was an architect. She was studying architecture. They started chatting and they clicked."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2678
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ea724bd7:

    # bet "Parecía que el resto del mundo no existía para ellos, como si fuéramos estatuas decorativas del bar."
    bet "It looked like the rest of the world didn't exist to them, as if we were decorative statues in the bar."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2679
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_fabb8ff0:

    # bet "Se pasaron toda la noche juntos, charlando y riendo. Conociéndose."
    bet "They spent the whole night together, chatting and laughing. Getting to know each other."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2680
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a5680026:

    # mc "Y tú te sentiste fatal."
    mc "And you felt awful."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2682
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2d672509:

    # bet "Sí. No quiero endulzarlo. *Risa* Me comporté como una niña celosa de mi propia hermana."
    bet "Yeah. I don't want to sugarcoat it. *Laugh* I behaved like a child, jealous of my own sister."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2683
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8afc0df8:

    # bet "*Risa* Me pasé toda la noche pensando en mil formas de asesinar a [mee] cuando fuéramos a la caravana a dormir."
    bet "*Laugh* I spent all night thinking of a thousand ways to murder [mee] when we went to the camper to sleep."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2684
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8411fb7d:

    # mc "Pero no lo hiciste. *Risa* Si todos los asesinatos mentales sucedieran, no quedaría nadie en el mundo."
    mc "But you didn't. *Laugh* If all the mental murders happened, there'd be no one left in the world."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2686
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ba3e7d41:

    # bet "No lo hice porque [mee] no vino a dormir a la caravana ninguna de las dos noches."
    bet "I didn't do it because [mee] didn't come to sleep in the camper that night nor the next."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2687
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e04a5c20:

    # mc "Eso es sorprendente, viniendo de Meemaw."
    mc "That's surprising, coming from Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2689
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_bb687e89:

    # bet "Ella también era joven entonces. *Risa* Y recuerda lo del amor a primera vista."
    bet "She was young then, too. *Laugh* And you should remember the love at first sight."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2690
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_7c5b2432:

    # mc "Amor a primera vista y sexo a primer parpadeo. *Risa* Pero sigo sin entender qué tiene que ver eso con lo que pasó el otro día."
    mc "Love at first sight and sex at first blink. *Laugh* But I still don't understand what that has to do with what happened the other day."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2692
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_77c5b7ce:

    # bet "Ni [mee] ni John sabían lo que yo sentía por él. Con lo que di un paso a un lado y empecé mi descenso a los infiernos."
    bet "Neither [mee] nor John knew how I felt about him. Whereupon I took a step aside and began my descent into hell."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2693
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ba4ae07c:

    # mc "Así que John es quien, sin saberlo, te empujó a frecuentar esas compañías inadecuadas de las que hablaste."
    mc "So, John is the one who, unknowingly, pushed you to frequent those unsuitable companies you spoke of."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2694
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2b019f8b:

    # mc "Y finalmente hacerte monja..."
    mc "And to finally becoming a nun..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2696
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_433c9882:

    # bet "No, no me empujó él. Me empujó el no saber gestionar mis emociones."
    bet "No, he didn't push me. I was pushed by not knowing how to manage my own emotions."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2697
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ab94bc8b:

    # bet "Era una niña imbécil que no podía soportar ver al hombre del que me había enamorado con otra."
    bet "I was an idiotic girl who couldn't bear to see the man I'd fallen in love with dating someone else."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2698
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_dd5d1635:

    # bet "Y menos aún con mi hermana."
    bet "And even less so dating my sister."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2700
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e194d768:

    # bet "Sentía como si [mee] me lo hubiera robado. *Risa triste* No me podía robar algo que nunca fue mío, pero era como me sentía."
    bet "I felt like [mee] stole him from me. *Sad laughter* She couldn't steal something from me that was never mine, but it was how I felt."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2701
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_55a20160:

    # mc "Te entiendo. Las comidas familiares tuvieron que ser una pesadilla para ti."
    mc "I hear you. Family meals had to have been a nightmare for you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2703
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_d4ba9580:

    # bet "Lo fueron durante un tiempo, la boda de [mee] incluida. Después ya no."
    bet "They were for a while, [mee]'s wedding included. Then they weren't anymore."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2704
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_636b4824:

    # bet "Me alegré mucho por ellos, pero dejé de ir a esas comidas. Siempre buscaba una excusa para quedarme en Stanford."
    bet "I was very happy for them, but I stopped going to those meals. I was always looking for an excuse to stay at Stanford."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2706
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e4232a8c:

    # bet "Eso me distanció de [mee] y de tus bisabuelos. Me sentí muy sola durante años."
    bet "That distanced me from [mee] and your great-grandparents. I felt very lonely for years."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2708
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a13fabc5:

    # bet "Eso me distanció de [mee] y de mis padres. Me sentí muy sola durante años"
    bet "That distanced me from [mee] and my parents. I felt very lonely for years."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2709
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5e2cf973:

    # mc "Y encontraste a la iglesia que llenó ese vacío."
    mc "And you found the church and that helped fill that void."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2711
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_23b458a9:

    # bet "Sí, pero fue mucho más tarde. Me volqué en estudiar primero y en trabajar después."
    bet "Yes, but it was much later. I poured myself into studying first and working after I finished my degree."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2712
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2fb56829:

    # bet "Cuando acabé la carrera, mientras hacía la residencia en San José descubrí que la religión ayudaba a muchas personas a superar sus pérdidas."
    bet "When I became a doctor, while doing residency at San Jose, I discovered that religion helped many people work through their losses."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2714
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_3f08b0e8:

    # bet "Empecé a ir a la iglesia y poco tiempo después lo dejé todo atrás y me hice monja. El resto ya lo sabes."
    bet "I started going to church and, shortly after that, I left it all behind and became a nun. You already know the rest."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2716
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f8cafc43:

    # mc "Y todo ese tiempo estuviste enamorada del abuelo, ¿no? ¿Hasta que murió?"
    mc "And all that time you were in love with Grandpa, weren't you? Until he died?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2718
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_14e82712:

    # mc "Y todo ese tiempo estuviste enamorada de John, ¿no? ¿Hasta que murió?"
    mc "And all that time you were in love with John, weren't you? Until he died?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2720
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_979cf0f8:

    # bet "No tanto, pero lo estuve durante mucho tiempo."
    bet "Not so much, but I was for a long time."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2721
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_0f4baa8f:

    # bet "Hasta que, a principios de los 90, me fui a África y descubrí que mis problemas eran nimiedades comparados con los del resto del mundo."
    bet "Until, in the early 90's, I went to Africa and discovered that my problems were trifles compared to the rest of the world's."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2722
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e649715c:

    # bet "Una historia de amor no correspondido que duró más de 10 años, y en la que no hay culpables aparte de mí."
    bet "An unrequited love story that lasted more than 10 years, and in which there are no culprits apart from me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2723
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_d12f1b69:

    # mc "No creo que haya culpables, ni siquiera tú. Te enamoraste y lo guardaste en silencio. Otra mujer se llevó al chico."
    mc "I don't think there are guilty parties, not even you. You fell in love and kept it quiet. Another woman got the guy."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2725
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_d68451be:

    # bet "Por eso es por lo que más culpable me sentí todos esos años. Mi cabeza estaba llena de escenarios que no pasaron."
    bet "That's why I felt guilty all those years. My head was full of scenarios that didn't happen."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2726
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_b10aa4ec:

    # bet "¿Qué hubiera pasado si le hubiera dicho a John lo que sentía por él antes de presentarle a [mee]?"
    bet "What would have happened if I had told John how I felt about him before introducing him to [mee]?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2727
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_360a42cb:

    # bet "¿Hubiera sido correspondida? ¿Hubiéramos durado? ¿Hubiera sido un matrimonio tan bonito como el que tuvo [mee]?"
    bet "Would it have been reciprocated? Would we have lasted? Would it have been as nice a marriage as the one [mee] had?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2728
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_3d127226:

    # mc "Son cosas que no puedes saber, con lo que no tienes que pensar en eso. Solo te harás daño."
    mc "Those are things you can't know, so you don't have to think about it. You'll only hurt yourself."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2730
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c05bd513:

    # bet "Hacía años que no pensaba en eso. Hasta que pasó lo del otro día."
    bet "I hadn't thought about that for years. Until the other day happened."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2731
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e266889c:

    # mc "Y ahí vino el \"Otra vez\". Estabas viviendo otra vez lo mismo, con la misma persona."
    mc "And there came the \"once again\". You were living the same thing all over again, with the same person."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2733
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e608e602:

    # mc "Pero esta vez era yo en vez del abuelo."
    mc "But this time it was me instead of Grandpa."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2735
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5ac837c0:

    # mc "Pero esta vez era yo en vez de John."
    mc "But this time it was me instead of John."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2737
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5d2be7a8:

    # bet "No pareces sorprendido."
    bet "You don't look surprised."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2738
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_22eb8a58:

    # mc "No lo estoy. Empecé a sospecharlo aquel día en el que hablamos de por qué [kia] me estaba evitando."
    mc "I'm not. I started to suspect something was up that day we talked about why [kia] was avoiding me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2739
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_4a03f641:

    # mc "Después de lo que pasó en el baño, has sido tú la que me evitabas."
    mc "After what happened in the bathroom, you've been the one avoiding me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2740
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_dc27d420:

    # mc "Y tu historia me ha dado el contexto para entender el \"Otra vez\", que era la única pieza que me faltaba."
    mc "And your story has given me the context to understand the \"once again\", which was the one piece I was missing."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2742
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_eaa2602f:

    # bet "Pues ahora lo entiendes todo. Me siento estúpida."
    bet "Well, now that you understand everything. I feel stupid."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2743
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_b3961c59:

    # mc "¿Por qué?"
    mc "Why?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2745
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_dc1ef5d1:

    # bet "Por mil razones. Porque me he vuelto a enamorar de una persona que no debo."
    bet "For a thousand reasons. Because I fell in love again with a person I shouldn't have."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2747
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_92d4465f:

    # bet "Porque esa persona es mi sobrino nieto."
    bet "Because that person is my great-nephew."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2748
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_0e60839f:

    # bet "Porque soy 1,000 años mayor que él."
    bet "Because I am 1,000 years older than him."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2749
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_03e19a9b:

    # bet "Porque, aunque existiera la remota posibilidad de que quisieras estar conmigo, yo no podría porque soy monja."
    bet "Because, even if there was the remote possibility that you wanted to be with me, I couldn't because I'm a nun."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2750
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8949cccb:

    # bet "Porque soy una vieja estúpida..."
    bet "Because I'm a stupid old woman..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2751
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ad386c7e:

    # mc "Te voy a hacer dos preguntas, que es lo único que no he entendido."
    mc "I'm going to ask you two questions, which are the only things I don't understand."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2752
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_269ca14d:

    # bet "Dime..."
    bet "Tell me..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2754
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_93174448:

    # mc "¿Te has enamorado de mí o del reflejo que ves del abuelo en mí?"
    mc "Have you fallen in love with me or with the reflection you see of Grandpa in me?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2756
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_025c7aa9:

    # mc "¿Te has enamorado de mí o del reflejo que ves de John en mí?"
    mc "Have you fallen in love with me or with the reflection you see of John in me?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2758
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_0d0dbd6c:

    # bet "¿Cuándo te has vuelto así?"
    bet "When did you become like this?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2759
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9eed75b0:

    # mc "¿A qué te refieres?"
    mc "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2760
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_3551d6e0:

    # bet "Hace dos semanas no hubieras preguntado eso. No te hubieras ni siquiera dado cuenta. Ni te lo hubieras planteado."
    bet " You wouldn't have asked that question two weeks ago. You wouldn't have even noticed. You wouldn't even have thought about it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2761
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e6c9391d:

    # mc "He tenido una buena maestra a la hora de observar cosas. No he pasado tanto tiempo contigo como me gustaría, pero el suficiente para aprender algunos trucos."
    mc "I had a good teacher when it comes to observing things. I haven't spent as much time with you as I would have liked, but enough to learn a few tricks."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2763
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_1c7cf176:

    # bet "Empecé en pensar en ti de una forma inapropiada porque me recordabas a John."
    bet "I started thinking about you in an inappropriate way because you reminded me of John."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2764
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_0df00951:

    # bet "Pero me he dado cuenta de que lo que me gusta de ti son las cosas que te hacen diferente a él."
    bet "But I've come to realize that what I like about you are the things that make you different from him."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2765
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f47f1290:

    # mc "Lo que significa que no era tan perfecto... pedos aparte."
    mc "Which means he wasn't so perfect... farts aside."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2767
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f0e80352:

    # bet "*Risa* No era perfecto. Y tú tampoco lo eres, no empieces a buscar un pedestal al que subirte."
    bet "*Laugh* He wasn't perfect. And you're not either, don't start looking for a high horse to ride."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2768
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_83479e7a:

    # bet "Pero tú tienes virtudes que él no tenía, y algunas que él tenía son más grandes en ti. Pero lo mismo pasa con los defectos."
    bet "But you have virtues that he didn't have, and some that he had are greater in you. But it's the same with flaws."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2770
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_ccd78334:

    # bet "Tan solo es que... tu combinación de virtudes y defectos es diferente..."
    bet "It's just that... your combination of strengths and weaknesses is different..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2771
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e0946371:

    # bet "Me recuerdas mucho a él. También a [mee] se lo recuerdas. Pero no sois la misma persona."
    bet "You remind me a lot of him. You also remind [mee] of him. But you are not the same person."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2772
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_d89a9f1a:

    # bet "Pero hay una segunda pregunta..."
    bet "But there is a second question..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2773
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a896bf5b:

    # mc "Y esa va a ser la más complicada."
    mc "And that's going to be the trickiest one."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2774
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_116a5016:

    # mc "¿Cómo querrías que acabara esto? Como has dicho, eres monja."
    mc "How do you want this to end? Like you said, you're a nun."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2776
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_81fa4560:

    # bet "No tengo una respuesta para esa pregunta. Y no es la pregunta que me esperaba."
    bet "I don't have an answer to that question. And it's not the question I was expecting."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2777
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_abc02a0b:

    # mc "¿Qué pregunta esperabas?"
    mc "What question did you expect?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2779
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9d736f53:

    # bet "No sé, algo en plan \"¿Te has vuelto loca, Tía [bet]?\" *Risa*"
    bet "I don't know, something along the lines of \"Have you gone crazy, Aunt [bet]?\" *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2780
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_48662069:

    # mc "¿Por qué iba a preguntarte algo así?"
    mc "Why would I ask you something like that?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2783
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_69825cdc:

    # bet "Porque es una locura."
    bet "Because it is crazy."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2784
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2acee1f5:

    # bet "Que yo sienta esto y que tengamos esta conversación precisamente hoy."
    bet "Maybe I do feel this and that is why we are having this conversation today."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2800
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e87268ed:

    # bet "Lo sé. Entre la edad, ser monja, y ni siquiera saber lo que quiero..."
    bet "I know. Between age, being a nun, and not even knowing what I want..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2801
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_52142a7a:

    # mc "Principalmente la última razón. Creo que tienes la cabeza hecha un lío ahora mismo."
    mc "Mainly the last reason. I think your head's a mess right now."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2802
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_98030007:

    # mc "Estás muy presionada con esta visita y me parece que estás buscando experiencias que viviste antes de ser monja por si tienes que dejar de serlo."
    mc "You're under a lot of pressure with this visit and it sounds like you're looking for experiences you had before you were a nun in case you have to stop being one."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2804
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_19d38509:

    # bet "Empecé a sentir algo por ti antes de saber nada de esta visita..."
    bet "I started to feel something for you before I knew anything about this visit..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2805
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_b986d233:

    # mc "Pero esos sentimientos han crecido desde que lo sabes, ¿verdad?"
    mc "But those feelings have grown since you knew, haven't they?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2806
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_726b97aa:

    # bet "Sí..."
    bet "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2807
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8955be1d:

    # mc "Hagamos un trato. Resolvamos lo de la visita al obispado y después volvemos a hablar sobre cómo te sientes. ¿Te parece bien?"
    mc "Let's make a deal. Let's work out the bishopric visit, and then we'll come back and talk about how you feel. Is that okay with you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2808
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_de7d5078:

    # mc "De esa forma sabrás hacia dónde va tu vida y qué quieres hacer con ella."
    mc "That way you'll know where your life is going and what you want to do with it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2810
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_df3e1714:

    # bet "Me parece un buen plan. Creo que tienes razón y que la incertidumbre de este viaje me está afectando más de lo que debería."
    bet "Sounds like a good plan. I think you're right and that the uncertainty of this trip is affecting me more than it should."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2813
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_90897d00:

    # bet "¿Qué? Ahora el que estás loco eres tú."
    bet "What? Now you're the one who's crazy!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2814
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_3ce076c4:

    # mc "No quiero influir en tu decisión sobre qué hacer hoy pero, de todos los impedimentos que has puesto, es el único que veo insalvable."
    mc "I don't want to influence your decision on what to do today but, of all the impediments you've put up, it's the only one I see as insurmountable."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2815
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_1910dd40:

    # mc "Quiero que la decisión que tomes, la tomes por ti, no por mí. No tengo ningún derecho a pedirte que dejes de ser monja y no lo voy a hacer."
    mc "I want you to make the decision for you, not for me. I have no right to ask you to stop being a nun, and I'm not going to."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2817
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_55466a06:

    # bet "¿Me estás diciendo que, si no fuera monja, estarías conmigo?"
    bet "Are you telling me that, if I wasn't a nun, you'd want to be with me?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2818
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_4cecda61:

    # mc "Te estoy diciendo que, si no fueras monja, tendríamos una posibilidad de estar juntos."
    mc "Yes, I'm telling you that, if you weren't a nun, we'd have a chance of being together."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2819
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2e5cde8c:

    # mc "Sé que no estarías a gusto si pasara mientras aún lo eres. Y no quiero que esto pese en tu decisión de qué hacer hoy."
    mc "I know you wouldn't be comfortable if it happened while you still are one. And I don't want this to weigh into your decision of what to do today."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2821
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_844e3a3d:

    # bet "Pero no me puedes pedir eso..."
    bet "But you can't ask me that..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2822
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_8354474c:

    # mc "Exacto. NO te lo estoy pidiendo."
    mc "Exactly. I am NOT asking you to do anything."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2823
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_a57d3d10:

    # mc "Cuando ese secretario te diga qué opciones tienes, deberás decidir qué quieres hacer con tu vida."
    mc "When that secretary tells you what choices you have, you must decide what you want to do with your life. Figure out what’s best for you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2824
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_1440bb4c:

    # mc "Decidas lo que decidas, yo voy a apoyarte."
    mc "Whatever you decide, I'm going to support you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2825
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_158f2936:

    # mc "Y no quiero que esa decisión tenga nada que ver con esta conversación. Lo tienes que decidir por lo que quieres tú."
    mc "And I don't want that decision to have anything to do with this conversation. You have to decide what it is you want."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2827
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_24a83dd2:

    # bet "Estás pidiendo un imposible. ¿Cómo no voy a tener en cuenta lo que has dicho?"
    bet "You're asking for something impossible. How can I disregard what you've said?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2828
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_b6788258:

    # mc "Porque primero tienes que saber lo que te dicen. Después tienes que decidir qué quieres."
    mc "Because you have to listen to what they have to tell you first. Then you have to decide what you want."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2829
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_30cf15e2:

    # mc "Si te dicen que puedes volver a África, ¿lo dejarías correr y dejarías de ser monja?"
    mc "If you were told you could go back to Africa, would you let it slide and stop being a nun?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2831
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_690d08fe:

    # bet "Seguramente me arrepentiría si lo hiciera..."
    bet "I would surely regret it if I did..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2832
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_36abd58f:

    # mc "Por eso tienes que decidir una vez sepas que opciones tienes. No en base a esta conversación, sino en base a lo que tú quieres hacer."
    mc "That's why you have to decide once you know what options you have. Not based on this conversation, but based on what you want to do."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2833
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c27ce51f:

    # mc "Pero si decides dejar de ser monja, porque tú quieres dejar de serlo, me gustaría que tuviéramos una oportunidad."
    mc "But if you decide to stop being a nun, because you want to stop being a nun, I'd like us to have a chance."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2835
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_4293882f:

    # mc "¿Y sabes una cosa, Tía [bet]? Pase lo que pase hoy, decidas lo que decidas, te voy a seguir queriendo. Todos lo vamos a hacer."
    mc "And you know something, Aunt [bet]? Whatever happens today, whatever you decide, I'm still going to love you. We all are."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2837
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c7e0f64c:

    # bet "Gracias, [mc]. Nadie podría pedir una familia mejor."
    bet "Thank you, [mc]. No one could ask for a better family."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2838
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_c8acdb43:

    # bet "Y sobre la familia..."
    bet "And about the family..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2840
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_f63b975f:

    # "Pasáis los siguientes 40 minutos charlando de cómo ha cambiado la familia en los días que hace que llegaron las estudiantes, [bet] y [mee]."
    "You spend the next 40 minutes chatting about how the family has changed in the days since the students, [bet] and [mee] arrived."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2841
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_53deecef:

    # "Ninguno de vosotros podría imaginar cómo iba a evolucionar. Los dos estáis contentos de cómo lo ha hecho."
    "Neither of you could've imagined how it was going to evolve. You're both happy with how it has."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2842
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_9abf102f:

    # "Dejáis la conversación aparcada para más adelante."
    "You tacitly leave the earlier conversation parked for later."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2844
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_098d5e8b:

    # "Cuando estáis a mitad de la ruta..."
    "When you're halfway to Monterey..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2845
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5e1f901f:

    # emm "*Bostezo* ¿Falta mucho? ¡Me estoy meando!"
    emm "*Yawn* How much longer until we get there? I have the urge to pee!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2846
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_905c0ea0:

    # mc "*Risa* La Bella Durmiente se ha despertado y se ha convertido en La Bella Meona."
    mc "*Laugh* The Sleeping Beauty has woken up and turned into The Pissing Beauty."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2847
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_adb3d7ff:

    # mc "Queda poco más de una hora."
    mc "There is just over an hour left."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2849
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_5ce2ed8e:

    # emm "¿Podemos parar en algún bar de carretera? Os invito a desayunar de nuevo y así voy al lavabo."
    emm "Can we stop at a roadside bar? I'll buy you guys breakfast again so I can go to the restroom."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2850
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_47b16007:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Segundo desayuno? ¿Has comprobado si tienes los pies peludos?"
    mc "*Laugh* Second breakfast? Have you checked to see if you have hairy feet?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2852
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_98d377a6:

    # bet "Creo que [emm] no va a pillar la referencia."
    bet "I think [emm] is not going to catch the reference."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2853
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_835c8bda:

    # mc "Yo creo que sí. Le gustan las películas de fantasía."
    mc "I think she will. She likes fantasy movies."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2855
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_2c8220af:

    # emm "¡Claro que lo he pillado! Es de El Señor de los Pendientes. No es tan buena como La Novia Princesa, pero no está mal."
    emm "Of course I got it! It's from The Lord of the Earrings. It's not as good as The Fiancée Princess, but it's not bad."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2856
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_e116c8b7:

    # emm "Y me estoy meando."
    emm "And I will piss myself if we don't stop soon."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2857
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_4bdcfd18:

    # mc "*Risa* En cinco minutos pasaremos por King City. Hay varios sitios para comer allí."
    mc "*Laugh* In five minutes we'll pass King City. There are several places to eat there."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2859
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_456d7e0d:

    # "Paráis a desayunar de nuevo en King City. [emm] apenas llega al lavabo."
    "You stop for second breakfast in King City. [emm] barely makes it to the restroom."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2860
translate english c23s006_AfterBreakfastBetConfession_7777aded:

    # "La única que pide un desayuno completo es [bet]. Ni siquiera la preocupación por la reunión le quita el hambre."
    "The only one who asks for a full breakfast is [bet]. Even worrying about the meeting doesn't diminish her hunger."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2866
translate english c23s006_Rent_0c456281:

    # "Finalmente llegáis a la agencia de alquiler de coches..."
    "You finally arrive at the car rental agency..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2867
translate english c23s006_Rent_665081d0:

    # emm "¡Es precioso! ¡Pink Dreams! ¡Es un sueño hecho realidad!"
    emm "It's beautiful! Pink Dreams! It's a dream come true!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2868
translate english c23s006_Rent_2000b3ce:

    # mc "Vamos antes de que me empiecen a sangrar los ojos con tanto rosa."
    mc "Let's enter before my eyes start bleeding from all that pink."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2869
translate english c23s006_Rent_adfcaa2c:

    # emm "¡Qué poco gusto!"
    emm "What poor taste!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2871
translate english c23s006_Rent_48260182:

    # "Amber" "Hola, buenos días, soy Amber. ¿En qué puedo ayudarles?"
    "Amber" "Hello, good morning, I'm Amber. How can I help you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2872
translate english c23s006_Rent_6f08a874:

    # mc "Teníamos una reserva para un Ferrarini rosa. A nombre de [mc] Marks."
    mc "We had a reservation for a pink Ferrarini. Under the name of [mc] Marks."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2873
translate english c23s006_Rent_91e507dd:

    # mcp "(¡Qué forma de destrozar esos coches pintándolos de rosa!)"
    mcp "(What a way to wreck those cars by painting them pink!)"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2875
translate english c23s006_Rent_c455070a:

    # "Amber mira directamente a [bet]."
    "Amber looks directly at [bet]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2876
translate english c23s006_Rent_a2e96bfc:

    # "Amber" "He mirado el expediente y he visto que también ha contratado las clases de conducción segura para deportivos con nuestro instructor Chad."
    "Amber" "I looked at the file and saw that you have also contracted the safe driving lessons for sports cars with our instructor Chad."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2877
translate english c23s006_Rent_9c578732:

    # "Amber" "En breve estará aquí. Justo a tiempo para que, cuando acabemos el papeleo, la pueda llevar a comer. La comida está incluida en el curso."
    "Amber" "He will be here shortly. Just in time so that when we finish the paperwork. He'll also take you out for lunch. Lunch is included in the price of the training."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2879
translate english c23s006_Rent_75933c3b:

    # emm "¿Unas clases de conducción de deportivos? ¿Esa era la sorpresa? ¡Eres el mejor hermano del mundo!"
    emm "Driving lessons for sports cars? Was that the surprise? You're the best brother in the world!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2880
translate english c23s006_Rent_fb5e1891:

    # mc "Conducción {b}segura{/b} de deportivos."
    mc "{b}Safe{/b} driving lessons for sports cars."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2882
translate english c23s006_Rent_92805b84:

    # "Amber mira alternativamente a [emm] y a [bet] como si no entendiera nada."
    "Amber alternately looks at [emm] and [bet] as if she doesn't understand anything."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2883
translate english c23s006_Rent_8755467d:

    # "Amber" "Perdón por la confusión. Esas clases las suelen contratar señoras... más maduras. Muchas de ellas repiten el curso."
    "Amber" "Sorry for the confusion. Those lessons are usually taken by... more mature ladies. Many of them repeat the training."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2884
translate english c23s006_Rent_faabfd68:

    # mc "En este caso, las lecciones son un regalo para mi hermana."
    mc "In this case, the lessons are a gift for my sister."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2886
translate english c23s006_Rent_e818b96a:

    # emm "No veo el Ferrarini aquí. ¿Dónde está? ¿Qué modelo es? ¿Podemos ir a verlo?"
    emm "I don't see the Ferrarini here. Where is it? What model is it? Can we go see it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2887
translate english c23s006_Rent_d8ef348f:

    # mc "Veo que estás impaciente."
    mc "I can feel your impatience. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2889
translate english c23s006_Rent_6805dc70:

    # "Amber" "Sí, podemos ir a verlo antes de hacer el papeleo. Sígame por aquí."
    "Amber" "Yes, we can go see it before we do the paperwork. Follow me this way."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2890
translate english c23s006_Rent_b26d677c:

    # "Amber" "Es nuestro modelo más valioso y lo tenemos apartado del resto."
    "Amber" "It's our most exclusive model and we have it set apart from the rest."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2892
translate english c23s006_Rent_26fcca02:

    # "Amber abre una puerta con un mando a distancia y allí está el peor atentado contra el buen gusto de la historia de la automoción."
    "Amber opens a door with a remote control and you can see the most outrageous murderous attempt on good taste in automobile history."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2894
translate english c23s006_Rent_023fcdde:

    # emm "¡Oh! ¡Es el Ferrarini F69 de 2018! ¡Tiene 660 CV y puede llegar a 355 Km/h! ¡Me encanta este coche!"
    emm "Oh! It's the 2018 Ferrarini F69! It has 660 hp and can reach 355 km/h! I love that car!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2896
translate english c23s006_Rent_d882cbb8:

    # emm "Pero este no se comercializó en ese color... Solo en rojo o en negro."
    emm "But it was not marketed in that color... Only in red or black."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2898
translate english c23s006_Rent_e89101dd:

    # "Amber" "Todos nuestros coches son pintados localmente para que proporcionen una experiencia más exclusiva."
    "Amber" "All our cars are painted locally so that they provide a more exclusive experience."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2899
translate english c23s006_Rent_df9a0882:

    # "Amber" "Tenemos tres tonos de rosa dependiendo del tipo de coche."
    "Amber" "We have three shades of pink depending on the type of car."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2901
translate english c23s006_Rent_f4a0d06c:

    # emm "¡Han hecho un trabajo exquisito! ¡Sácame una foto con el logo, [mc]!"
    emm "They've done an exquisite job! Take a picture of me with the logo, [mc]!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2903
translate english c23s006_Rent_9ff5d38a:

    # emm "Que salga bien el Jaballino. Da lo mismo que no me encuadres bien a mí."
    emm "Get a good pic of the Piglettino. It doesn't matter if you don't frame me right."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2904
translate english c23s006_Rent_2a0cfc61:

    # emm "Sí, ya sé que es Cinghialetto. Pero me gusta más como lo digo yo. Más fotos."
    emm "Yes, I know it's a Cinghialetto. But I like it better the way I say it. More pics."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2905
translate english c23s006_Rent_a2af1c25:

    # mc "Creo que sería mejor fuera que en un garaje."
    mc "I think it would be better outside than in a garage."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2906
translate english c23s006_Rent_34c9d6a6:

    # emm "¡Ya habrá tiempo para eso! ¡Hazme un par de fotos ahora!"
    emm "There'll be time for that! Take a couple of pictures of me and the car now!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2908
translate english c23s006_Rent_f8177bba:

    # "Tomas varias fotos de [emm] posando con el coche. Apenas se atreve a tocarlo."
    "You take several pictures of [emm] posing with the car. She barely dares to touch it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2910
translate english c23s006_Rent_d7fbe99b:

    # "Amber" "Miren, por allí llega nuestro instructor Chad. Se ha adelantado."
    "Amber" "Oh good, here is our instructor, Chad. He's early."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2911
translate english c23s006_Rent_229f631e:

    # "Amber" "Buenos días, Chad."
    "Amber" "Good morning, Chad."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2913
translate english c23s006_Rent_f5ba0928:

    # "Puedes entender por qué las señoras maduras contratan el curso de conducción."
    "You can understand why mature ladies choose the driver training."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2914
translate english c23s006_Rent_b2741f27:

    # "Chad se dirige directamente a [bet]."
    "Chad heads straight to [bet]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2915
translate english c23s006_Rent_db84fff6:

    # "Chad" "Buenos días, señora. ¿Preparada para la mejor experiencia automovilística de su vida con Chad?"
    "Chad" "Good morning, ma'am. Are you ready for the best automotive experience of your life with Chad?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2917
translate english c23s006_Rent_aff2351e:

    # bet "*Risa* Creo que te equivocas, Chad."
    bet "*Laugh* I think you have it wrong, Chad."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2919
translate english c23s006_Rent_9409452e:

    # bet "Amber, ¿me puedes decir dónde está el lavabo? Voy a ir a cambiarme mientras le presenta a Chad a su clienta."
    bet "Amber, can you tell me where the restroom is? I'm going to go change while you introduce Chad to his customer."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2921
translate english c23s006_Rent_479bdf44:

    # "Unos minutos después, una vez acabadas las presentaciones y el papeleo..."
    "A few minutes later, once the introductions and paperwork are finished..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2922
translate english c23s006_Rent_c060a39f:

    # emm "Entonces nos vemos aquí en tres horas, ¿no?"
    emm "So, we'll meet back here in three hours, right?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2923
translate english c23s006_Rent_41170b53:

    # mc "Bueno, la reunión es en una hora y media. No sé cuánto durará."
    mc "Well, the meeting is in an hour and a half. I don't know how long it will last."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2924
translate english c23s006_Rent_847e04d9:

    # mc "El curso de conducción segura acaba en tres horas, con lo que seguramente nosotros acabaremos antes."
    mc "The safe driving lesson ends in three hours, so we'll probably finish sooner than you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2926
translate english c23s006_Rent_2a10c184:

    # emm "Conducción segura {b}de deportivos{/b}. *Risa*"
    emm "Safe driving lessons {b}for sports cars{/b}. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2927
translate english c23s006_Rent_a0fc9c2e:

    # mc "Sí, vale. Te he mandado la dirección del motel en el que nos alojaremos, por si nos retrasamos y quieres ir a descansar."
    mc "Yes, okay. I've sent you the address of the motel we're staying at, in case we get delayed and you want to go get some rest."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2928
translate english c23s006_Rent_a0644686:

    # mc "En cuanto acabemos te llamo y quedamos en algún sitio."
    mc "As soon as we're done, I'll call you and we'll meet somewhere."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2929
translate english c23s006_Rent_339f1f96:

    # emm "Perfecto."
    emm "Perfect."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2932
translate english c23s006_Rent_bd67ed74:

    # emm "*Susurrando* Te daría un beso, pero seguro que Amber se escandaliza después de decirle que eras mi hermano."
    emm "*Whispering* I'd kiss you, but I'm sure Amber would be shocked after telling her you were my brother."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2933
translate english c23s006_Rent_6b4f6085:

    # mc "*Susurrando* No creo que se escandalice demasiado, teniendo en cuenta las señoras maduras que contratan a Chad. *Risa*"
    mc "*Whispering* I don't think she'd be too shocked, considering the mature ladies who hire Chad. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2935
translate english c23s006_Rent_33a146cb:

    # emm "*Susurrando* Creo que el curso para señoras maduras con Chad debe incluir alguna cosa más que conducir, viendo su aspecto."
    emm "*Whispering* I think the training for mature ladies with Chad should include something other than driving, seeing what he looks like."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2936
translate english c23s006_Rent_74a6046c:

    # mc "*Susurrando* Estoy seguro de ello."
    mc "*Whispering* I'm sure of it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2938
translate english c23s006_Rent_9fdb4cfa:

    # emm "*Susurrando* Pues que no espere nada conmigo. No es para nada mi tipo."
    emm "*Whispering* Well, he shouldn't expect anything with me. He's not my type at all."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2940
translate english c23s006_Rent_aa8ef0d9:

    # emm "*Susurrando* Me gustan más como tú."
    emm "*Whispering* I like them more like you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2941
translate english c23s006_Rent_a2cc8b2a:

    # mc "*Risa* Te veo luego. [bet] ya está saliendo del lavabo."
    mc "*Laugh* I'll see you later. [bet] is already coming out of the restroom."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2943
translate english c23s006_Rent_e7b71ffd:

    # bet "Disfruta del coche y no dejes que Chad haga nada que no debe, [emm]."
    bet "Enjoy the car and don't let Chad do anything he shouldn't, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2944
translate english c23s006_Rent_a312c07f:

    # mc "*Risa* Precisamente estábamos hablando de eso."
    mc "*Laugh* We were just talking about that."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2946
translate english c23s006_Rent_3a64c416:

    # bet "¿Nos vamos, entonces?"
    bet "Shall we go, then?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2947
translate english c23s006_Rent_ded19230:

    # mcp "(Claramente no tiene ganas de ir a esa reunión. Yo tampoco las tendría.)"
    mcp "(She clearly doesn't feel like going to that meeting. I wouldn't either.)"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2948
translate english c23s006_Rent_8fbff358:

    # mc "Sí, vámonos."
    mc "Yes, let's go."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2950
translate english c23s006_Rent_53d871ed:

    # emm "Suerte, Tía [bet]."
    emm "Good luck, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2951
translate english c23s006_Rent_6a4fac72:

    # mcp "(A veces [emm] es sorprendentemente maravillosa.)"
    mcp "(Sometimes [emm] is surprisingly wonderful.)"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2952
translate english c23s006_Rent_303d6258:

    # bet "Gracias, cielo."
    bet "Thank you, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2956
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_f874252a:

    # "Después de una comida en la que intentas levantarle los ánimos sin éxito, llevas a [bet] a la catedral de Monterey."
    "After a lunch in which you unsuccessfully try to lift her spirits, you take [bet] to Monterey Cathedral."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2957
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_7b15b09b:

    # "La reunión tendrá lugar en un edificio cercano a la catedral."
    "The meeting will take place in a building near the cathedral."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2958
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_b5b10e17:

    # bet "Aquí estamos..."
    bet "Here we are..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2959
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_dd568640:

    # mc "No tienes ganas de entrar, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You don't feel like going in, do you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2961
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_2beddb44:

    # bet "Ahora mismo me apetecería más pegarme un martillazo en el pie que entrar ahí."
    bet "Right now, I'd feel more like hammering myself in the foot than going in there."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2962
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_cdb4a5bb:

    # mc "Te entiendo. Pero ¿sabes qué me decía [nor] cuando no quería hacer algo de niño?"
    mc "I hear you. But do you know what [nor] used to tell me when I didn't want to do something as a kid?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2964
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_46d10b95:

    # bet "Que cuanto antes lo hicieras, antes podrías dedicarte a otras cosas que te gustan más."
    bet "That the sooner you did that, the sooner you could devote yourself to other things you like better."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2965
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_9ef0b9a7:

    # mc "Veo que la frase tiene raíces profundas en la familia. Son exactamente las mismas palabras."
    mc "I see that the quote has deep roots in the family. Those are exactly the same words."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2967
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_86fa3e95:

    # bet "*Risa triste* Es una frase que nos decía mi abuela cuando íbamos a visitarla a Missouri."
    bet "*Sad laughter* It's a sentence my grandmother used to tell us when we'd go visit her in Missouri."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2969
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_791a2692:

    # bet "Tu bisabuela se la decía a [nor] y a [mar]. Es una frase que suelen decir las abuelas de la familia."
    bet "Your great-grandmother used to say it to [nor] and [mar]. It's a phrase often said by the grandmothers in the family."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2971
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_78a73330:

    # bet "Mi madre se la decía a [nor]. Es una frase que suelen decir las abuelas de la familia."
    bet "My mother used to say it to [nor]. It's a phrase usually said by the grandmothers in the family."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2972
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_5435b956:

    # mc "Y ahora invertimos el proceso y te la digo yo, igual que [nor] me la dijo a mí."
    mc "And now we reverse the process, and I'm the one telling it to you, just like [nor] told it to me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2973
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_427b4919:

    # mc "¿Quieres que te acompañe?"
    mc "Do you want me to walk you in?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2975
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_83e3f56b:

    # bet "Gracias, pero será mejor que entre sola. De todas formas, a la reunión no puedes asistir."
    bet "Thanks, but I'd better go in alone. You can't attend the meeting anyway."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2976
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_b6b048eb:

    # mc "Entonces iré al motel a dejar las maletas y vuelvo a buscarte. He visto un café en el que puedo esperarte."
    mc "Then I'll go to the motel to drop off the bags and come back to get you. I saw an ice cream parlor where I can wait for you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2977
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_ef862ae9:

    # mc "Llámame cuando salgas y vengo en dos minutos."
    mc "Call me when you finish the meeting and I'll be here in two minutes."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2979
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_854f9db8:

    # bet "Me parece perfecto. No sé cuánto voy a tardar y no quiero que te quedes en el coche todo este rato."
    bet "Sounds perfect to me. I don't know how long I'm going to be, and I don't want you to stay in the car under the sun all this time."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2980
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_5155cd4f:

    # mc "¿Quieres un abrazo antes de ir?"
    mc "Do you want a hug before you go?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2982
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_7dc9295c:

    # bet "Me encantaría, pero mejor no. *Risa triste* Si me abrazas ahora no voy a querer ir."
    bet "I'd love to, but I'd better not. *Sad laughter* If you hug me now, I'm not going to want to go."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2983
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_6bc1a3fa:

    # mc "Entonces sin abrazos."
    mc "No hugs, then."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2984
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_7a2874a6:

    # mc "Suerte, Tía [bet]."
    mc "Good luck, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2986
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_303d6258:

    # bet "Gracias, cielo."
    bet "Thank you, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2988
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_59dfcd2a:

    # "Puedes ver como Tía [bet] se dirige al edificio de oficinas de la diócesis con los hombros hundidos, como un fantasma azul."
    "You can see how [bet] heads for the diocese office building with her shoulders slumped, like a blue ghost."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2989
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_9d3303d5:

    # "La batalla que tenga que librar ahí dentro está perdida antes de empezar."
    "Whatever battle she has to fight in there, is lost before it even starts."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2991
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_1635f2b6:

    # "Vas al motel a dejar las maletas de [bet] y [emm] en una habitación y tu mochila en otra."
    "You go to the motel to drop [bet] and [emm]'s luggage in one room and your backpack in another."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2992
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_ceec7348:

    # "[bet] ha dejado la ropa que llevaba puesta para el viaje en la camioneta. La dejas allí por si se quiere cambiar después."
    "[bet] left the clothes she was wearing for the trip in the pickup truck. You leave them there in case she wants to change later."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2993
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_76d4436f:

    # "Vuelves al barrio de la catedral y te tomas un café en una heladería a tres minutos del edificio donde [bet] está teniendo la reunión."
    "You go back to the cathedral district and have a coffee at the ice cream parlor three minutes from the building where [bet] is having her meeting."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2994
translate english c23s006_RideBetChurch_8b918e17:

    # "No disfrutas del café. Estás casi tan nervioso por el resultado como lo estaba [bet] al entrar."
    "You don't enjoy the coffee. You're almost as nervous about the outcome as [bet] was going in."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:2999
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_df34c2a7:

    # "La reunión se alarga tanto que [emm] te llama para decirte que ya ha acabado el curso."
    "The meeting goes on so long, [emm] calls you to tell you the driving lesson is over."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3001
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_185cb950:

    # emm "Hey, [mc]. ¿Aún no habéis acabado la reunión?"
    emm "Hey, [mc]. Are you guys done with the meeting yet?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3002
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_41cb7534:

    # mc "No, estoy esperando a que Tía [bet] me llame para recogerla e ir a buscarte."
    mc "No, I'm waiting for Aunt [bet] to call me to pick her up and then come get you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3004
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_e6d88fd1:

    # emm "No te preocupes por mí. Ya he acabado el curso y voy a conducir un rato. ¡Este coche es increíble!"
    emm "Don't worry about me. I'm done with the lesson and I'm going to drive for a while. This car is awesome!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3005
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_b5b66e29:

    # mc "¿Qué tal el curso?"
    mc "How was the lesson?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3007
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_67eda2dc:

    # emm "¡Genial! Aunque estoy casi segura de que Chad se saca un extra como gigoló con las maduras, realmente es un profesional."
    emm "Great! Although I'm pretty sure Chad pulls off an extra as a gigolo with the mature ladies, he really is a pro."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3008
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_80d5d336:

    # emm "Fue piloto de pruebas en un equipo de la WEC durante varios años."
    emm "He was a test driver on a WEC team for several years."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3009
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_f4eba33d:

    # mc "¿WEC?"
    mc "WEC?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3011
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_4977e205:

    # emm "El World Endurance Championship, el mundial de resistencia... 24 horas de Le Mans y ese tipo de carreras."
    emm "The World Endurance Championship.... 24 Hours of Le Mans and that kind of racing."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3013
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_6c6bc686:

    # emm "A veces parece que el hombre en esta relación sea yo. No sabes nada de coches."
    emm "Sometimes it looks like I'm the man in this relationship. You don't know anything about cars."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3015
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_38254f85:

    # emm "A veces parece que yo sea el hermano y tú la hermana. No sabes nada de coches."
    emm "Sometimes it seems like I'm the brother and you're the sister. You don't know anything about cars."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3017
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_49730f47:

    # emm "¡Pero alquilas unos coches de puta madre!"
    emm "But you rent some fucking great cars!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3018
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_ac6e7f7f:

    # mc "Me alegra que lo estés disfrutando. Me hubiera gustado estar contigo y que lo disfrutáramos juntos."
    mc "I'm glad you're enjoying it. I would have liked to have been with you and for us to enjoy it together."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3020
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_ea46b0f5:

    # emm "A mí también me hubiera gustado, pero entiendo que no podemos dejar a Tía [bet] sola."
    emm "I would have liked it too, but I understand that we can't leave Aunt [bet] alone."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3021
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_b635a88c:

    # mc "*Risa* Tu concepto de \"podemos\" es un poco especial. Yo estoy aquí y tú estás conduciendo un coche hortera."
    mc "*Laugh* Your concept of \"we can't\" is a tad special. I'm here and you're driving a tacky car."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3023
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_a9df7e34:

    # emm "*Risa* ¡Qué poco gusto tienes para los coches!"
    emm "*Laugh* What poor taste you have for cars!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3024
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_fe44a410:

    # mc "Eso es discutible. *Risa* Si no se comercializaba en rosa, por algo será..."
    mc "That's debatable. *Laugh* If it wasn't marketed in pink, there must be a reason..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3025
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_1f2f1237:

    # mc "Por cierto, sabes que si te ponen una multa de velocidad me tocará pagarla a mí, ¿verdad?"
    mc "By the way, you do know that, if you get a speeding ticket, I'll have to pay for it, right?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3026
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_7304d0d2:

    # mc "Aunque sea un coche de alquiler, las multas llegan igualmente. Y te las pienso pasar a ti para que las pagues."
    mc "Even if it's a rental car, the fines are still applied. And I plan to pass them on to you for you to pay."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3028
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_507c29bd:

    # emm "¡Oops! No lo sabía. Pero no te preocupes... no estoy corriendo... {b}demasiado{/b}."
    emm "Oops! I didn't know that. But don't worry... I'm not speeding.... {b}too much{/b}."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3029
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_6f48d758:

    # mc "*Risa* Ese \"demasiado\" me da mucho miedo."
    mc "*Laugh* That \"too much\" scares the hell out of me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3031
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_ff2af8d1:

    # emm "Una pregunta, ¿mi nombre está en algún sitio en el motel? Es decir... ¿puedo ir y pedir una llave de la habitación?"
    emm "One question, is my name anywhere in the motel? I mean... can I go and ask for a room key?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3032
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_9188fde9:

    # mc "Sí, ya he avisado en la recepción que era posible que fueras y les pidieras una llave. Estás en la habitación número 6."
    mc "Yes, I already let the guy at the front desk know that it was possible for you to go and ask them for a key. You're in room number 6."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3033
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_9165b904:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Estás cansada?"
    mc "Why? Are you tired?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3035
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_bbed22e2:

    # emm "No, es que es posible que compre algunas cosas para las chicas y me gustaría dejarlas en la habitación en vez de llevarlas en el coche todo el día."
    emm "No, it's just that I want to buy some things for the girls, and I'd like to leave them in the room instead of carrying them in the car all day."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3036
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_2dd5ec5c:

    # mc "¿Has visto algún souvenir? *Risa* Solo espero que no necesites comprar una cuarta maleta para llevar los regalos."
    mc "Have you seen any souvenirs? *Laugh* I just hope you don't need to buy a fourth suitcase to carry the gifts."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3038
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_0a8e6cd1:

    # emm "Más o menos. *Risita* Te veo luego. Avísame cuando Tía [bet] acabe, a ver dónde estoy."
    emm "Sort of a souvenir. *Giggle* I'll see you later. Let me know when Aunt [bet] is done. Let's see where I am then. *Chuckle*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3039
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_031b37f6:

    # mc "Si conduces demasiado, es posible que acabes en San Francisco... *Risa* con un montón de multas de velocidad."
    mc "If you drive too much, you might end up in San Francisco.... *Laugh* with a bunch of speeding tickets."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3040
translate english c23s006_FerrariniGirl_9c47d0e7:

    # emm "No te preocupes. *Risa* No voy a llegar tan lejos. Hasta luego."
    emm "Don't worry. *Laugh* I'm not going to make it that far. See you later."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3044
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_44117e4a:

    # "Media hora y dos cafés después, [bet] te avisa de que ya ha salido. Le propones ir a buscarla, pero cuando le dices dónde estás, decide unirse a ti en el café."
    "Half an hour and two coffees later, [bet] lets you know she is finished. You propose to go and pick her up, but when you tell her where you are, she decides to join you at the cafe."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3045
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_7529841f:

    # "Avisas a [emm] de que [bet] ya está llegando y le mandas tu ubicación. Está en el motel y llegará en 15 minutos."
    "You let [emm] know that [bet] is on her way and send her your location. She's at the motel and will be at the ice parlor in 15 minutes."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3046
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_54937a4c:

    # "La monja llega cinco minutos después y se va inmediatamente a poner la ropa que llevaba durante el viaje mientras llega la chica del Ferrarini."
    "The nun arrives five minutes later, and she leaves immediately to change into the clothes she was wearing during the trip while the Ferrarini girl arrives."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3047
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_2f523696:

    # "[bet] no quiere empezar a explicarte cómo ha ido la reunión para tener que volver a hacerlo cuando llegue [emm]."
    "[bet] doesn't want to start explaining to you how the meeting went only to have to start again when [emm] arrives."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3049
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_89a31f19:

    # "Cuando estáis los tres por fin sentados a la mesa..."
    "When the three of you are finally seated at the table..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3050
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_76548f66:

    # emm "Me muero de impaciencia, Tía [bet]. ¿Qué te han dicho?"
    emm "I'm dying of impatience, Aunt [bet]. What did they tell you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3052
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_140ce337:

    # bet "El secretario me ha dicho que hice bien en negarme a operar a aquel muchacho."
    bet "The secretary told me that I was right to refuse to operate on that boy's brain."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3053
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_1fd1471c:

    # mc "Eso es bueno, ¿no?"
    mc "That's good, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3054
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_fce9380f:

    # bet "Pero que hice mal en informar a su padre, el jefe tribal, de que el obispo Bakari le había engañado diciéndole que la homosexualidad se podía curar."
    bet "But that I was wrong in informing his father, the tribal chief, that Bishop Bakari fooled him by telling him that homosexuality could be cured."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3055
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_96743008:

    # bet "El obispo es una figura muy importante en la iglesia de Tanzania y... ha pedido mi cabeza."
    bet "The bishop is a very important figure in the Tanzanian church and.... He asked for my head."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3057
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_63794710:

    # emm "¡Que hijo de puta! Supongo que se refiere a que no vuelvas a Tanzania, ¿no?"
    emm "What a motherfucker! I guess that means you can't go back to Tanzania, doesn't it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3059
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_5d2c44a7:

    # bet "Ni a Tanzania ni a ningún otro lugar de África."
    bet "Neither to Tanzania nor to any other place in Africa."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3060
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_34cb8151:

    # mc "Entonces solo te queda lo de trabajar en hospitales en California..."
    mc "Then you're only left with the option of working in the California hospitals you talked about..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3062
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_078df519:

    # bet "Eso tampoco."
    bet "That neither."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3063
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_ae35ad01:

    # bet "La iglesia me da dos opciones. Entrar en un convento de clausura en los Estados Unidos o jubilación en otro convento de mi elección en Latinoamérica."
    bet "The church gave me two options. To enter a cloistered convent in the United States or retirement in another convent of my choice in Latin America."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3065
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_86c23442:

    # emm "¿Por qué? No lo entiendo. ¿Tú lo entiendes?"
    emm "Why? I don't understand. Do you get it?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3066
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_2b63b98c:

    # mc "Si está aquí en un convento en el que pueda hablar con la prensa, podría liarla parda. Por eso aquí el convento es de clausura."
    mc "If she's here in a convent where she can talk to the press, she could make a big deal out of it. That's why here the convent is cloistered."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3067
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_0c2b8817:

    # mc "Si está jubilada en un convento en... yo qué sé... Nicaragua o Bolivia... La prensa de allí no le prestará atención."
    mc "If she's retired to a convent in... I don't know... Nicaragua or Bolivia... The press there won't pay any attention to her."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3068
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_f27c25a1:

    # mc "Y si habla con la prensa, la iglesia puede decir que la jubilaron con antelación porque ya no pensaba con claridad."
    mc "And if she talks to the press, the church can say she was retired early because she was no longer thinking clearly."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3070
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_1c2fa445:

    # mc "¿Me equivoco?"
    mc "Am I wrong?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3071
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_28a3741f:

    # bet "No lo ha dicho así, pero tienes razón sobre sus motivos."
    bet "He didn't say it like that, but you're right about his motives."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3072
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_e064dfa2:

    # bet "Sea como sea no volveré a ejercer en ningún hospital."
    bet "Whichever I choose, I will never practice in a hospital again."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3074
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_94f0859e:

    # emm "No volverás a ejercer si sigues siendo monja, ¿no?"
    emm "You won't practice again if you're still a nun, isn't that correct?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3075
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_6e09d1d7:

    # emm "Podrías dejar la iglesia y seguir trabajando. Problema resuelto."
    emm "You could leave the church and keep working. Problem solved."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3077
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_94c7a5e2:

    # bet "Me tendría que volver a certificar para poder ejercer de cirujana en los Estados Unidos."
    bet "I would have to recertify in order to practice as a surgeon in the United States."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3078
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_d0b6a0d2:

    # bet "Y eso vale dinero, no tengo ni idea de cuánto. En mi plan de trabajar en hospitales católicos, esa certificación la pagaba la iglesia..."
    bet "And that costs money and I have no idea how much. In my plan to work in Catholic hospitals, that certification was paid for by the church...."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3079
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_e6940cd5:

    # mc "Por el dinero no te preocupes."
    mc "You don't need to worry about money."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3081
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_050d8cb9:

    # emm "Tenemos una empresa millonaria. Podemos pagar tu certificación sin problemas."
    emm "We have a billion-dollar company. We can pay for your certification. No problem."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3082
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_0b57ea3e:

    # mc "Bueno, no con dinero de NTR. Sería un gasto injustificable."
    mc "Well, not with NTR money. It would be an unjustifiable expense."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3083
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_6009a7e8:

    # mc "Pero yo puedo pedir un adelanto de mi sueldo para pagar por tu certificación. Y dudo que el CEO de NTR lo rechace."
    mc "But I can ask for an advance on my salary to pay for your certification. And I doubt the CEO of NTR would turn it down."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3085
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_55389b78:

    # bet "No os puedo pedir eso..."
    bet "I can't ask that of you..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3086
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_99751757:

    # mc "No lo estás pidiendo. Lo estamos ofreciendo nosotros."
    mc "You're not asking for it. We're offering it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3087
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_f0ef9c25:

    # mc "El sábado voy a actuar como CEO por primera vez, y pienso cobrar por ello. Ese dinero es tuyo para la certificación."
    mc "On Saturday, I'm going to take over as CEO for the first time, and I plan to get paid for it. That money is yours for the certification."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3089
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_82ed1e9d:

    # bet "..."
    bet "..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3090
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_f878632a:

    # mc "Tía [bet]... ¿Estás bien?"
    mc "Aunt [bet]... Are you okay?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3092
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_b5b31101:

    # emm "¿Qué pasa, Tía?"
    emm "What's wrong, Auntie?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3094
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_6423ffeb:

    # bet "No me merezco esta familia..."
    bet "I don't deserve this family..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3095
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_3c3e34d0:

    # mc "Te mereces esto y más."
    mc "You deserve this and more."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3097
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_0db44c4a:

    # emm "Estoy de acuerdo con [mc]. Todos querríamos ayudarte, y todo el mundo estaba muy preocupado por tu situación."
    emm "I agree with [mc]. We would all want to help you, and everyone was very worried about your situation."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3098
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_54b45c27:

    # emm "Si [mc] se negara a sí mismo el adelanto de sueldo, estoy segura de que entre todas conseguiríamos el dinero para tu certificación."
    emm "If [mc] denied himself the pay advance, I'm sure that, between all of us, we would get you the money for your certification."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3100
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_93f90172:

    # emm "Seguro que para alguien como [lis] y [deb.nick], lo que cuesta la certificación es calderilla, y dijeron que podíamos contar con ellas para lo que necesitáramos."
    emm "Surely for someone like [lis] and [deb.nick], what the certification costs is pocket change, and they said we could count on them for whatever we needed."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3101
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_e9157e62:

    # emm "Aunque no hablamos de dinero, claro, porque no sabíamos que eso podría ser el problema."
    emm "Although we didn't talk about money, of course, because we didn't know that could be the problem."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3103
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_55001268:

    # mc "Todo el mundo va a querer ayudarte. No te preocupes por eso."
    mc "Everyone is going to want to help you. Don't worry about it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3104
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_761152f7:

    # bet "Pero..."
    bet "But..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3106
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_6819fc88:

    # emm "Y [dap] y [sca] te ayudarán a estudiar si es necesario... Hay que estudiar para la certificación, ¿no?"
    emm "And [dap] and [sca] will help you study, if you need it.... You need to study for the certification, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3107
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_f6ee4e4b:

    # emm "Yo también te ayudaría, pero no tengo ni idea de medicina."
    emm "I would help you too, but I know nothing about medicine."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3109
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_597e2389:

    # bet "Chicos... me estáis emocionando..."
    bet "Guys... you're getting me emotional..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3110
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_a7073025:

    # mc "La familia está para eso, Tía [bet]. No sólo para cuando todo va bien, sino para apoyarnos cuando hay algún problema."
    mc "That's what family is for, Aunt [bet]. Not just for when everything is going well, but to support each other when there's a problem."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3111
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_9da09452:

    # mc "¿Cuándo les tienes que dar una respuesta?"
    mc "When do you have to give them an answer?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3113
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_cd37e247:

    # bet "Me han dado dos meses para pensármelo. Mañana tengo que pasar a recoger una documentación sobre los diferentes conventos que proponen."
    bet "They've given me two months to think about it. Tomorrow, I have to pick up some documentation about the different convents they are offering."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3114
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_21bc1964:

    # bet "Todo eso, obviamente, bajo la condición de que no hable con la prensa nunca."
    bet "All that, obviously, under the condition that I don't talk to the press ever."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3115
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_a57063ee:

    # mc "¿Qué te pueden hacer si hablas con la prensa?"
    mc "What can they do to you if you talk to the press?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3117
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_79da8654:

    # bet "Podrían eliminar la opción del convento en Latinoamérica, que era la menos mala."
    bet "They could drop the convent option in Latin America, which was the best among two bad options."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3118
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_c2fe0315:

    # bet "De todas formas, no pensaba hablar con la prensa. No serviría de nada. El obispo Bakari no se vería afectado."
    bet "I wasn't planning to talk to the press anyway. It wouldn't do any good. Bishop Bakari wouldn't be affected."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3120
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_2dc9513a:

    # emm "Bueno, como no vas a hablar con la prensa ni vas a coger esa opción, no tenemos que hablar de eso ahora."
    emm "Well, since you're not going to talk to the press or take the Latin America option, we don't need to talk about it now."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3121
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_df7a30d6:

    # mc "Tienes razón, [emm]. Ahora hay dos meses para sopesar opciones y pensar en qué podemos hacer y cómo hacerlo."
    mc "You're right, [emm]. Now there are two months to weigh options and think about what we can do and how to do it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3123
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_aa316288:

    # bet "No hay mucho que pensar. Si me prestáis el dinero..."
    bet "There's not much to think about. If you lend me the money..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3124
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_33e8120e:

    # mc "No es un préstamo, es un regalo."
    mc "It's not a loan, it's a gift."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3126
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_ae5cced6:

    # bet "{b}Si me prestáis el dinero{/b} para certificarme, creo que mi mejor opción sería abandonar la iglesia..."
    bet "{b}If you lend me the money{/b} to get certified, I think my best option would be to leave the church..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3127
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_8f7740d3:

    # bet "Y empezar a buscar trabajo como cirujana... a mi edad... Ufff..."
    bet "And to start looking for a job as a surgeon... at my age.... Phew..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3128
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_b233d797:

    # mc "Bueno, si piensas que es la mejor opción no vamos a intentar convencerte de lo contrario. Tienes dos meses para pensártelo."
    mc "Well, if you think it's the best option, we're not going to try to convince you otherwise. You have two months to think about it."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3130
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_c2e00819:

    # emm "Y para alegrarte un poco el día, hoy invito yo a pizza."
    emm "And to make your day a little brighter, pizza is on me today."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3131
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_462726fc:

    # emm "Por si estabas triste había buscado pizzerías con buenas reseñas."
    emm "I looked for pizzerias with good reviews, in case you were sad."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3132
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_c25289da:

    # mc "A veces eres sorprendente, [emm]. Cada vez más."
    mc "Sometimes you are amazing, [emm]. Every day a bit more."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3134
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_64416a28:

    # bet "¿Crees que me puedes comprar con comida, [emm]?"
    bet "Do you think you can buy me with food, [emm]?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3136
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_6010d2ad:

    # emm "No quería que sonara así, Tía... perdona..."
    emm "I didn't mean it to sound like that, Auntie... I'm sorry..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3138
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_40b9e80e:

    # bet "Porque si lo crees, tienes toda la razón. *Risa*"
    bet "Because if you believe it, you're absolutely right. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3139
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_db62733e:

    # mc "*Risa* Vamos al motel a ducharnos y vamos a ver qué pizzería ha encontrado [emm]."
    mc "*Laugh* Let's go to the motel to take a shower and go see what pizza place [emm] found."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3141
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_afab1693:

    # "Ver que se han abierto más opciones de las que había planteado la iglesia ayuda a mejorar los ánimos."
    "Seeing that more options opened up than the ones the church presented, helps to improve the mood."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3142
translate english c23s006_AfterTheMeeting_8401a92d:

    # "Vais al motel a ducharos y cambiaros de ropa. Te pones la camisa azul."
    "You go to the motel to shower and change clothes. You put on your blue shirt."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3150
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3151
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_26e5f8ba:

    # "Suena tu teléfono, es [ama]."
    "Your phone rings, it's [ama]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3153
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_b9b20d75:

    # mc "Hola, [ama]. ¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mc "Hello, [ama]. Can I help you with anything?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3155
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_921677e6:

    # ama "Sólo llamábamos para saber cómo había ido la reunión de Tía [bet]. No queremos molestarla a ella."
    ama "We are just calling to find out how Aunt [bet]'s meeting went. We don't want to bother her. [eva] is here, too. You're on speaker."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3156
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_d1e46081:

    # eva "Hubiéramos llamado antes, pero no sabíamos a qué hora iba a terminar la reunión."
    eva "We would have called earlier, but we didn't know what time the meeting was going to end."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3157
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_8279e80c:

    # mc "Bueno, ha ido como uno de los peores escenarios que habíamos pensado."
    mc "Well, it went like one of the worst-case scenarios we could think of."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3158
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_8e598236:

    # mc "La propuesta de la iglesia es que se retire a un convento."
    mc "The church's proposal is that she retires to a convent."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3160
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_d1718586:

    # eva "¡Putos cabrones! ¿Necesitas que hagamos una visita a ese obispo para convencerle... sutilmente?"
    eva "Fucking bastards! Do you need us to pay that bishop a visit to convince him... subtly?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3161
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_ba40ba01:

    # mc "No, [eva]. Tía [bet] tiene que darles una respuesta en dos meses, con lo que hay tiempo para pensar qué quiere hacer."
    mc "No, [eva]. Aunt [bet] has to give them an answer in two months, so there's time to think about what she wants to do."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3163
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_99d6c0b8:

    # ama "Si quieres... podemos buscar cosas sobre ese obispo, o sobre el de Tanzania, para poder hacer más presión y que cambien de opinión."
    ama "If you want... we can look for things about that bishop, or about the Tanzanian bishop, so we can put some pressure on him and get them to change their minds."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3164
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_b04b3be0:

    # mc "Creo que Tía [bet] no querría eso. Ahora mismo se siente como que no pertenece a la Iglesia. Se siente traicionada."
    mc "I think Aunt [bet] wouldn't want that. Right now, she feels like she doesn't belong in the Church. She feels betrayed."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3165
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_b86234e6:

    # mc "Por eso se tomará estos meses para sopesar dejar de ser monja. Casi lo ha decidido ya."
    mc "That's why she'll take these months to think about quitting being a nun. She's almost decided already."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3167
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_2dbe68e6:

    # ama "Es lógico. La quieren esconder después de lo de Tanzania, y eso es cruel."
    ama "It's logical. They want to hide her after the Tanzania thing, and that's cruel."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3168
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_7cad4306:

    # mc "Por lo que me ha explicado, esa es exactamente su intención, que acabe sus días en un sitio donde no moleste."
    mc "From what she explained to me, that is exactly their intention, that she end her days in a place where she won't be a bother."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3169
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_5d374c27:

    # mc "Y donde no pueda hablar con la prensa."
    mc "And where she can't talk to the press."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3171
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_5f6a0907:

    # eva "¡Putos cabrones! Necesito dispararle a algo. Dale un abrazo de mi parte a Tía [bet]."
    eva "Fucking bastards! I need to shoot at something. Give Aunt [bet] a hug on my behalf."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3172
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_9fa74b4e:

    # mc "¡[eva]!"
    mc "[eva]!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3174
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_7a9a2ae8:

    # ama "Ya se ha ido. Cuando se le desatan sentimientos que no puede controlar hace prácticas de tiro. Ya lo viste ayer."
    ama "She's already gone. When her feelings get worked up and she can't control them, she does target practice. You saw it yesterday."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3175
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_6991613d:

    # mc "Espero no enfadarla nunca..."
    mc "I hope I never make her angry..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3178
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_26a478e8:

    # ama "Hasta vuestra primera cita, como mínimo, estás seguro. *Risa*"
    ama "Until your first date, at the very least, you're safe. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3179
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_60db5d70:

    # mc "Entonces tendremos la primera cita dentro de muchos años. *Risa*"
    mc "Then we will have the first date many years from now. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3180
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_a787076b:

    # ama "Si la retrasas mucho dejarás de estar seguro también. *Risa*"
    ama "If you delay it too much, you'll stop being safe also. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3182
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_06c6a38d:

    # ama "Si no te disparó ayer después de rechazarla, supongo que puedes considerarte seguro."
    ama "If she didn't shoot you yesterday after you turned her down, I guess you can consider yourself safe."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3183
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_826e85ca:

    # mc "¿Necesitas algo más? Iba a llevar a las chicas a cenar..."
    mc "Do you need anything else? I was going to drive the girls out to dinner..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3185
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_4edac293:

    # ama "Solo una cosa más. Es una idea que se les ha ocurrido a Jamaal y a [nor], pero puede esperar si tienes prisa."
    ama "Just one more thing. It's an idea Jamaal and [nor] came up with, but it can wait if you're in a hurry."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3186
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_a9665a34:

    # mc "No, tranquila, [emm] aún se está acabando de vestir. Dime."
    mc "No, there's no hurry, [emm]'s still getting dressed. Tell me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3188
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_7762f7d9:

    # ama "Jamaal y yo estábamos hablando de lo de los asistentes a la fiesta del barco de Iron Fist cuando ha aparecido [nor]."
    ama "Jamaal and I were just talking about the Iron Fist boat party attendees when [nor] appeared."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3189
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_61d4ff67:

    # ama "[nor] es muy inteligente y ha estado pensando en que, si reconvertimos NTR en una empresa médica, el nombre puede ser un lastre."
    ama "[nor] is very smart and has been thinking that, if we reconvert NTR into a medical company, the name may be a liability."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3190
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_e7d42cd0:

    # mc "*Risa* Ese nombre sería un lastre fuera como fuera."
    mc "*Laugh* That name would be a liability no matter what."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3192
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_187a4d9b:

    # ama "Algo parecido ha dicho Jamaal, pero no entiendo por qué."
    ama "Jamaal said something similar, but I don't understand why."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3193
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_02086512:

    # ama "[nor] lo decía porque NTR tiene un pasado militar y, en este país, puede ser un problema."
    ama "[nor] was saying it was because NTR has a military past and, in this country, that can be a problem."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3194
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_f594ed77:

    # mc "Tiene razón, pero no por el pasado militar, sino por las operaciones encubiertas. La gente desconfía de lo que se le oculta."
    mc "She's right, but not because of the military past, but because of covert operations. People distrust what is hidden from them."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3195
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_c2426e12:

    # mc "¿Ha propuesto cambiarle el nombre a la empresa?"
    mc "Has she proposed to change the company name?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3197
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_06b509fe:

    # ama "Más que cambiarle el nombre, crear una empresa filial y traspasar toda la actividad médica allí. Al menos a nivel comercial."
    ama "Rather than changing its name, create a subsidiary company and transfer all the medical activity there. At least on a commercial level."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3198
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_ac8b2401:

    # mc "Me parece bien. Así NTR quedará para soporte a otras empresas de operaciones encubiertas y la nueva empresa se ocupará de todo el tema médico."
    mc "I'm fine with that. That way, NTR will be left to support other black ops companies, and the new company will take care of all the medical stuff."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3200
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_a9164267:

    # ama "A Jamaal también le ha parecido una buena idea. Incluso se le ha ocurrido un nombre. Harnessing Advanced Research for Enhancing Medicine."
    ama "Jamaal also thought it was a good idea. He even came up with a name. Harnessing Advanced Research for Enhancing Medicine."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3201
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_0a88ead0:

    # ama "Aprovechar la investigación avanzada para mejorar la medicina. Aunque me parece un poco largo"
    ama "Though it seems a bit long to me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3202
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_72c20cb4:

    # mc "A mí me parece un buen nombre, podemos usar siglas como NTR..."
    mc "Sounds like a good name to me, we can use acronyms like NTR..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3203
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_5367af7b:

    # mc "Espera..."
    mc "Wait..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3204
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_91f9fbdb:

    # mc "*Risa* Jamaal es un capullo."
    mc "*Laugh* Jamaal is a dick."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3206
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_5dc56569:

    # ama "¿Qué pasa?"
    ama "What's wrong?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3207
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_5ceedf9e:

    # mc "¿No te has dado cuenta de cuáles serían las siglas? H.A.R.E.M."
    mc "Did you not realize what the acronym would be? H.A.R.E.M."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3209
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_18aedd9b:

    # ama "¡Me ha tomado el pelo! *Risa* Voy a decirle a [eva] que practique tiro contra sus ruedas."
    ama "He fooled me! *Laugh* I'm going to tell [eva] to practice shooting at his wheels."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3210
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_2459552a:

    # mc "*Risa* Si Jamaal empieza a gastarte bromas, significa que está dejando de teneros miedo. Es su forma de daros la bienvenida a la familia."
    mc "*Laugh* If Jamaal starts playing pranks on you, it means he's getting over being afraid of you. It's his way of welcoming you into the family."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3211
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_4dfc6171:

    # mc "*Risa* Pero sigue pareciéndome un buen nombre. Sigue la línea de NTR y GILF."
    mc "*Laugh* But it still seems like a good name to me. It follows in the vein of NTR and GILF."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3213
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_f5d9ea6d:

    # ama "Continúo sin entender qué tiene de malo NTR."
    ama "I continue to not understand what's wrong with NTR."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3214
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_290dcc15:

    # mc "Mucho, [ama]. Mucho."
    mc " A lot, [ama]. A lot."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3216
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_f3cd91b4:

    # mc "Puedes preguntárselo a [deb.nick] cuando la veas. *Risa*"
    mc "You can ask [deb.nick] when you see her. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3218
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3219
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_6aeda812:

    # emm "*A través de la puerta* [mc], ya estamos listas. Te esperamos en el coche."
    emm "*Through the door* [mc], we're ready. We'll wait for you in the car."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3220
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_c02ac796:

    # mc "Ahora voy. Un segundo."
    mc "I'm coming. One minute."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3222
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_7bd50a56:

    # ama "Ve antes de que [emm] se impaciente. *Risa* No sé si ese hotel tiene tienda de regalos, pero podría empezar a comprar cosas rosas."
    ama "Go before [emm] gets impatient. *Laugh* I don't know if that hotel has a gift boutique, but she might start buying pink stuff."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3223
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_a54e5e50:

    # mc "*Risa* No te preocupes, no hay tienda de regalos."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't worry, there's no gift store."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3224
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_cdc39172:

    # mc "Os mantengo informadas de cómo va lo de Tía [bet] mañana."
    mc "I'll keep you posted on how Aunt [bet]'s thing goes tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3226
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_a6bb3df2:

    # mc "Y has dicho que estaré seguro hasta la primera cita con [eva]. Tú y yo tenemos que planificar la nuestra también."
    mc "And you said I'll be safe until my first date with [eva]. You and I have to plan ours too."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3228
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_ac110be9:

    # mc "Y tú y yo tenemos una cita que planificar."
    mc "And you and I have a date to plan."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3231
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_13fd4da7:

    # ama "No te preocupes por eso. El otro día en el café cuenta como nuestra primera cita. Hubo besos. Suficiente para mí, al menos por ahora."
    ama "Don't worry about it. The other day at the cafe counts as our first date. There was kissing. Enough for me, at least for now."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3232
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_1c86b48c:

    # ama "Y vete antes de que Tía [bet] empiece a tener hambre. *Risa* Hasta mañana, [mc]."
    ama "And go before Aunt [bet] starts to get hungry. *Laugh* See you tomorrow, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3233
translate english c23s007_AmaCalls_69ad4751:

    # mc "Hablamos mañana, [ama]."
    mc "We'll talk tomorrow, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3240
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_452e6387:

    # "Pasáis una noche agradable, cenando y riendo, sin nombrar ni una sola vez el dilema de [bet]."
    "You spend a pleasant evening, dining and laughing, without once mentioning [bet]'s dilemma."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3241
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_eb458632:

    # "[emm] os explica emocionada todo lo que ha aprendido en el curso de conducción y por dónde ha conducido mientras os esperaba."
    "[emm] excitedly explains to you all she learned in the driving lesson and where she drove while waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3242
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_8a3270a9:

    # "Cuando le preguntas, se niega a decir qué ha comprado para las chicas en casa."
    "When you ask her, she refuses to say what she bought for the girls at home."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3244
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_96c1d5b6:

    # "Al llegar al hotel os dirigís a vuestras respectivas habitaciones."
    "Upon arrival at the motel, you head to your respective rooms."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3245
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_e2dd6b3a:

    # "Pasas una buena noche de descanso."
    "You have a good night's rest."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3248
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_9c10f707:

    # "Al llegar al hotel..."
    "Upon arriving at the hotel..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3249
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_bf7af1cf:

    # emm "¡Ay! ¡Uff!"
    emm "Ouch! Whew!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3250
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_05b11d12:

    # mc "¿Qué te pasa, [emm]?"
    mc "What's wrong, [emm]?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3252
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_d6407639:

    # emm "Te he dicho antes de salir que si tenía que dormir sentada me acabaría doliendo el cuello."
    emm "I told you before we left that, if I had to sleep sitting up, I would end up with a sore neck."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3253
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_2fe6ac9f:

    # emm "Entre eso y después el curso de conducción, lo tengo hecho polvo. Ahora entiendo por qué los pilotos tienen cuellos como troncos."
    emm "Between that and then the driving course, it's killing me. Now I understand why pilots have necks like logs."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3255
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_34e6e135:

    # bet "¿Quieres que te dé un masaje o algo?"
    bet "Do you want me to give you a massage or something?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3256
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_dd323ab7:

    # mc "O tomarte un analgésico."
    mc "Or you can take a painkiller."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3258
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_75440d8e:

    # emm "No hace falta. Con una buena noche de descanso..."
    emm "No need. With a good night's rest..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3260
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_71b9ad2d:

    # emm "¡Oh!"
    emm "Oh!"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3261
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_3b916da8:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa?"
    mc "What's wrong?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3263
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_4f341d25:

    # emm "No has cogido camas individuales, y cuando tengo este dolor de cuello me muevo mucho durmiendo."
    emm "You haven't booked single beds and, when I have this neck pain, I move around a lot in my sleep."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3264
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_964584cf:

    # emm "Voy a molestar a Tía [bet] y no le voy a dejar dormir."
    emm "I'm going to annoy Aunt [bet] and I'm not going to let her sleep."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3266
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_7dc2697f:

    # bet "No te preocupes, yo duermo como un tronco..."
    bet "Don't worry, I sleep like a log..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3268
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_6912d95d:

    # mc "Puedes dormir en mi cama y yo duermo en el sofá. No parece incómodo."
    mc "You can sleep in my bed, and I'll sleep on the couch. It doesn't seem uncomfortable."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3270
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_d20312a3:

    # emm "No podría hacerte eso. Es tu cama..."
    emm "I couldn't do that to you. It's your bed..."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3271
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_97a9ca7c:

    # emm "Pero has tenido una buena idea. ¿Por qué no nos cambiamos de habitación? Yo duermo en la tuya y tú en la mía."
    emm "But you had a good idea. Why don't we switch rooms? I'll sleep in yours and you sleep in mine."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3272
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_808af671:

    # mc "Porque acabas de decir que es una cama doble. No sé si Tía [bet] querrá compartirla conmigo."
    mc "Because you just said it's a double bed. I don't know if Aunt [bet] will want to share it with me."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3274
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_6910781a:

    # bet "No voy a permitir que duermas en un sofá."
    bet "I'm not going to let you sleep on a couch having room in a bed."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3276
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_344a8f78:

    # emm "¿Ves? Además, Tía [bet] seguro que ha traído un pijama nada sexy de esos de franela."
    emm "See? Besides, I'm sure Aunt [bet] did bring one of those flannel pajamas that aren't sexy at all."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3278
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_17664d9e:

    # bet "*Risa* ¿Has estado revolviendo en mi maleta? No es de franela, pero no creo que nadie pueda considerarlo sexy."
    bet "*Laugh* Have you been rummaging through my suitcase? It's not flannel, but I don't think anyone would consider it sexy."

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3279
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_079ee38a:

    # mc "¿Estás segura, Tía [bet]?"
    mc "Are you sure, Aunt [bet]?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3281
translate english c23s007_SleepingArrangements_da3bdc54:

    # bet "¿De que el pijama no es sexy o de que no voy a dejarte dormir en el sofá?"
    bet "About my pajamas not being sexy or about me not going to let you sleep on the couch?"

# game/scripts/c23/c23.rpy:3282
